:"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/63f3e08146a63834c028002e9dd702a3952d96a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T18:48:14Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:00:51Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat(workflow-roles): add GPT-5.5 to Copilot model list\n\nGPT-5.5 is the latest standard OpenAI model available in Copilot. Slotted\nabove GPT-5.4 in the OpenAI block (newest-first within versioned siblings,\nmatching the existing convention for Opus 4.7 vs 4.6).\n\nTier 2.0 / multiplier 1× / \"Pro and above\" — same shape as GPT-5.4. Tests\nthat lock the canonical option order are shifted accordingly (xAI moves\nfrom idx 11 → 12; tier-2 filter total 10 → 11).","tree":{"sha":"5b2f84bea3b76df0cb060c7ea83ecd6b5686bc2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/5b2f84bea3b76df0cb060c7ea83ecd6b5686bc2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/63f3e08146a63834c028002e9dd702a3952d96a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/63f3e08146a63834c028002e9dd702a3952d96a2","node_id":"C_kwDORt3vE9oAKDYzZjNlMDgxNDZhNjM4MzRjMDI4MDAyZTlkZDcwMmEzOTUyZDk2YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/2f888102748e95e88678e6fc9b8a259696fe0389","sha":"2f888102748e95e88678e6fc9b8a259696fe0389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/2f888102748e95e88678e6fc9b8a259696fe0389"}],"sha":"63f3e08146a63834c028002e9dd702a3952d96a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/63f3e08146a63834c028002e9dd702a3952d96a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/2f888102748e95e88678e6fc9b8a259696fe0389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-09T18:43:55Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-09T19:00:51Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat(workflow)!: per-agent role models in workflow.yaml + canonical preload\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: WorkflowRole.Model (single string) is removed. Subagent roles\nmust now declare a non-empty `models` map keyed by agent name (claude,\nopencode, copilot). Catalogs that still use `model:` will fail Validate().\n\nWhy\n---\nThe TUI model-selection step on a fresh install never received the yaml''s\ndeclared model defaults. app.go passed an empty []WorkflowManifest to\nRunWorkflowModelSelection (model selection runs before the catalog scan by\ndesign), so the synthetic fallback in workflow_models.go used `Model: roleName`\nplaceholders instead of real values. Even when the user later saved choices\nto devrune.yaml, the catalog could only express one tier per role across all\nagents — not enough for \"haiku on claude, claude-haiku-4.5 on opencode,\nClaude Haiku 4.5 on copilot\".\n\nSchema\n------\n  roles:\n    - name: sdd-explorer\n      kind: subagent\n      skill: sdd-explore\n      models:\n        claude: haiku\n        opencode: haiku\n        copilot: Claude Haiku 4.5\n\nValidate() now requires a non-empty `models` for kind: subagent and rejects\n`models` on kind: orchestrator.\n\nArchitecture\n------------\nDevRune fetches SDD''s workflow.yaml from the canonical catalog source\n(github:davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog) at wizard start via the existing\ncache layer, before the model-selection step. Cache makes subsequent runs\nnear-instant; first run is the same fetch the regular scan step performs\nmoments later. The synthetic hardcoded SDD role list is gone.\n\nRenderer migration\n------------------\nbuildWorkflowPlaceholderReplacements gains an `agentName` parameter; each\nrenderer (claude / opencode / copilot) passes its own name and reads\nrole.Models[agent] instead of role.Model. ModelFor(agent) is a new accessor\nthat returns the empty string when the map is nil.\n\nCloses #67","tree":{"sha":"9f56faaeecd7ba8748bd088ac0d213f12fe08071","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/9f56faaeecd7ba8748bd088ac0d213f12fe08071"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/2f888102748e95e88678e6fc9b8a259696fe0389","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/2f888102748e95e88678e6fc9b8a259696fe0389","node_id":"C_kwDORt3vE9oAKDJmODg4MTAyNzQ4ZTk1ZTg4Njc4ZTZmYzliOGEyNTk2OTZm