i.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/a65ebec713d1e36d11f4d272deb26b60755be501/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T10:42:26Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T11:00:00Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat(workflow): resolve components.skills against catalog root, not just workflow dir\n\nCloses #63.\n\nLift the constraint that every entry in `workflow.yaml`''s\n`components.skills` must be a subdirectory of the workflow itself.\nSkills can now live at the catalog top level (`catalog/skills/<name>/`)\nand still be declared as workflow dependencies — the renderer resolves\nthem automatically.\n\nWhy: SDD''s PRD gate invokes `Skill(\"write-a-prd\")` at workflow start.\nwrite-a-prd lives at `catalog/skills/write-a-prd/`, not under\n`catalog/workflows/sdd/`. Today the workflow can''t list it as a\ndependency, so users have to remember to add it to their `devrune.yaml`\npackage select; if they forget, SDD fails the moment the PRD gate\nfires.\n\nResolution order per skill name:\n1. Workflow-internal: `<workflow-dir>/<name>/SKILL.md`\n2. Catalog-level fallback: `<catalog-root>/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`\n3. Missing → error naming both attempted paths.\n\nImplementation:\n\n- `materialize/renderer.go`: `InstallWorkflow` interface gains a 4th\n  parameter `catalogRoot string` so renderers can resolve outside the\n  workflow dir. `materializer.go` passes the cached package root.\n- `materialize/renderers/helpers.go`: new `ResolveExternalSkillSource`\n  helper centralizes the catalog-level lookup with a clear error.\n- `materialize/renderers/{claude,opencode,copilot,factory,codex}.go`:\n  each renderer''s existing scan loop is unchanged for workflow-internal\n  skills; a follow-up external pass handles names listed in\n  `Components.Skills` that didn''t appear as workflow subdirs. Copilot\n  excludes orchestrator/sub-agent skills from the external pass since\n  those are delivered as `.agent.md` files, not regular skills.\n  OpenCode excludes the orchestrator name for the same reason.\n- `model/workflow.go`: Godoc on `Components.Skills` describes the\n  dual-location resolution.\n\nTests:\n\n- 5 helper tests covering: catalog-root resolution success, missing\n  skill error wording, empty catalog root, catalog root equals\n  workflow dir, SKILL.md required (not just dir).\n- Claude integration tests covering: external skill lands in\n  workspace and ManagedPaths; missing external skill produces clear\n  error with the skill name.\n- Existing tests updated to pass `catalogRoot` (mostly equal to\n  `cachePath` in unit tests, which exercises the workflow-internal\n  path unchanged).","tree":{"sha":"a4479a83e3f9235a14aa27633a39425f15549dba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/a4479a83e3f9235a14aa27633a39425f15549dba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/a65ebec713d1e36d11f4d272deb26b60755be501","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"co