s","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/341616d5d697c1d67649eddee684b9a6913100a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T08:08:20Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T18:23:54Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat(copilot): tier-based model routing for SDD phases\n\nVS Code Copilot enforces that sub-agents cannot use a model with a\nhigher cost tier than the orchestrator. This change wires that\nconstraint end-to-end:\n\n- model: add CopilotModelEntry with Tier field, CopilotModelOptionsUpTo,\n  CopilotTierForModel, and CopilotModelOptions; add copilot to\n  ModelRoutingAgents\n- tui/steps: inject orchestrator as first card in SDD phase selector;\n  reactive tier filtering (refilterCopilotPhaseCards) fires whenever the\n  orchestrator card changes; filter sdd-orchestrator from synthesised\n  roles to prevent duplicate row; linear ↑/↓ navigation through all\n  cards with ←/→ reserved for Confirm/Cancel; canonical phase order in\n  summary (orchestrator → explore → plan → implement → review → adviser)\n- renderers/copilot: write model field to orchestrator .agent.md\n  frontmatter from modelOverrides[\"sdd-orchestrator\"]\n- docs: add Copilot tier constraint note to README model routing section\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84299c4d59901ea7db393228f4713db200ec04f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/84299c4d59901ea7db393228f4713db200ec04f1"},"url":"https://a