/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/6088eb23609ae391d30f3916a06b734540b19e44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T14:12:33Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:07:58Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat(tui): add Configure role models menu option for SDD agents\n\nAdds a standalone ''Configure role models'' option to the TUI main menu\nthat lets users reconfigure AI models for SDD agent roles (claude,\nopencode) without running a full Setup wizard.\n\n- Menu option hidden when no model-routing agents in devrune.yaml\n- Reuses RunWorkflowModelSelection (parameterized with stepNum)\n- Cancel is a silent no-op; success auto-runs resolve+install\n- Extensible: auto-discovers all workflows with model-routing roles\n- Sentinel ErrModelSelectionCancelled replaces brittle string check\n- Menu order: Configure role models placed after Sync project\n\nCloses #41\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c1139336452067fb805c84ee9eb0fd014851222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/6c1139336452067fb805c84ee9eb0fd014851222"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/6088eb23609ae391d30f3916a06b734540b19e44","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizati