ublic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/845ed8b3508f775eb73d6379e2b7c6eb559b530b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T09:40:18Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:07:58Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat: add tiered compaction recovery hooks for SDD workflows\n\nAdd opaque JSON hook definitions per agent to preserve SDD workflow state\nacross context compactions. Each agent gets its tier-appropriate mechanism:\n\n- Claude (Tier 1a): PreCompact + SessionStart(compact) hooks via settings.json\n- Factory (Tier 1b): PreCompact hook via settings.json\n- OpenCode (Tier 2): .ts plugin auto-loaded from .opencode/plugins/\n- Codex/Copilot (Tier 3): catalog instructions only (no hooks)\n\nKey changes:\n- Add WorkflowHookDef/WorkflowHooksConfig types to workflow model\n- Add hooks.go with shared utilities (deepMergeJSON, ReadAndValidateHookJSON,\n  copyHookScriptAssets, collectStringValues, stripShellVarPrefix)\n- Each renderer deep-merges hook JSON into agent settings and copies scripts\n- OpenCode renderer handles .ts definitions directly (copy to plugins/)\n- Add hookAssetDirNames skip set so hooks/plugins dirs are not blindly copied\n  to all agents — only the agent declared in workflow.yaml receives them\n- Fix Factory commandDenylist serializing as null instead of []\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3af483628951a777309f2377919a7ab03f9e021d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/3af483628951a777309f2377919a7ab03f9e021d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/845ed8b3508f775eb73d6379e2b7c6eb559b530b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://