08c35dc2d3583a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T15:25:04Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:03:04Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"fix: false stale status when manifest has Skills.sh Curated packages\n\nStatus check computed manifest hash without expanding Skills.sh Curated\nsentinel entries, but the resolver expands them before hashing. This caused\nthe hashes to always differ, showing \"stale\" immediately after install.\n\nBoth status.go and menu.go now call expandSkillsShPackages() before\ncomputing the manifest hash, matching the resolver''s behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c21681c93da023a93441173f193c9a8318f52ef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/c21681c93da023a93441173f193c9a8318f52ef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/8afc7030418dbbc0c1eacf93508c35dc2d3583a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subs