struct literals for FrameworkSkills to\nDetectedTech (S1016), and remove unnecessary explicit type in test (QF1011).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c93e420a23450c31be7299ec355a91f7d3db8383","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/c93e420a23450c31be7299ec355a91f7d3db8383"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/796c64dc1effb4bb3be227e128cdae9a5e005382","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/796c64dc1effb4bb3be227e128cdae9a5e005382","node_id":"C_kwDORt3vE9oAKDc5NmM2NGRjMWVmZmI0YmIzYmUyMjdlMTI4Y2RhZTlhNWUwMDUzODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/6443d52cd2389077011d0fef3121b6de4020db67","sha":"6443d52cd2389077011d0fef3121b6de4020db67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/6443d52cd2389077011d0fef3121b6de4020db67"}],"sha":"796c64dc1effb4bb3be227e128cdae9a5e005382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/796c64dc1effb4bb3be227e128cdae9a5e005382"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/6443d52cd2389077011d0fef3121b6de4020db67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T08:05:23Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T08:32:45Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat(recommend): add skills.sh curated catalog integration\n\nAdd a static, team-curated catalog of skills.sh skills grouped by technology.\nThe wizard detects the project tech stack and surfaces audit-verified skills\n(ATH, Socket, Snyk — all PASS) alongside starter-catalog items.\n\n- New CatalogFetcher port with StaticCatalog adapter (internal/recommend)\n- Static registry: 17 entries across 12 frameworks + 5 languages\n- Tech detection reuses existing detect.Analyze() package\n- TUI: Skills.sh Curated as toggleable source in Step 2, grouped by\n  tech with non-interactive headers in Step 3\n- Pipeline wiring: selected skills expand to github: PackageRef via\n  SkillRefToPackageRef and flow through existing MultiFetcher cache\n- Generic empty-category filter hides zero-item categories for all sources\n- Cursor navigation skips hidden categories and header rows\n- 34+ unit tests for convert, catalog, items builder, TUI and pipeline\n\nZero runtime API dependency — the registry is compiled-in Go.\n\nCloses davidarce/devrune-starter-catalog#10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2cf1f53c7dc415867c304fd37c1813a642e755e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/a2cf1f53c7dc415867c304fd37c1813a642e755e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/6443d52cd2389077011d0fef3121b6de4020db67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/6443d52cd2389077011d0fef3121b6de4020db67