se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/34cd8aba7f9050e65ce6773a94528e365f1e3650/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-03T12:45:10Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-03T12:47:27Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"fix: add workingDir to workflows, fix agent isolation, and separate catalogs\n\n- Add workingDir and displayName to WorkflowMetadata, remove description\n- Introduce {WORKFLOW_DIR} placeholder for workflow files (orchestrator, _shared)\n- {SKILLS_PATH} now points to base skills directory only\n- Add {WORKFLOW_SUBAGENT_*} placeholders resolved per-renderer:\n  Claude/factory/codex → \"general\", OpenCode/copilot → role names\n- OpenCode installs workflow files in own workspace (.opencode/sdd-orchestrator/)\n  instead of shared .agents/skills/ to avoid conflicts\n- Fix synthesizeAgents skipped for opencode when skillAlreadyRendered\n- Generate CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md independently (no symlink)\n  CLAUDE.md uses .claude/ paths, AGENTS.md uses .agents/ paths\n- Normalize paths with filepath.Clean to avoid ../ in resolved paths\n- Fix init command: wire TUI wizard for interactive mode\n- Always call InstallWorkflow per-renderer (remove skillAlreadyRendered guard)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aee5784904069982fb0f44934768a6f5fca1bf30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/aee5784904069982fb0f44934768a6f5fca1bf30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/34cd8aba7f9050e65ce6773a94528e365f1e3650","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false