ce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/05629e10f132fca1e08ad9d58088bc471cf4a1ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T17:11:50Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T17:17:56Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat: interactive menu, uninstall, upgrade, and multiple fixes (#17)\n\nNew interactive menu (devrune or devrune init) with 5 actions:\n- Setup: full TUI wizard for agent configuration\n- Sync project: resolve + install from menu\n- Status: workspace state displayed in TUI\n- Upgrade DevRune: install.sh with confirmation\n- Uninstall: remove all managed files with double confirmation\n\nMenu loops back after each action (except upgrade which replaces binary).\n\nAdditional fixes:\n- Uninstall uses RemoveAll for directories, cleans AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md\n  managed blocks, removes .mcp.json, cleans empty workspace dirs\n- Managed paths now track settings files and rules directories\n- Status compares manifest hash (not lockfile hash) for staleness\n- Copilot .vscode/settings.json writes to project root (not .github/)\n- Removed addGitignoreEntry (redundant with managed block)\n- New workflow.yaml gitignore: field for artifact directories\n- syncCatalogs runs before resolve (prevents false stale status)\n- README updated with interactive menu screenshot\n\nAlso includes example devrune.yaml, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md for the\nDevRune project itself.\n\nCloses #17\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d72d41eff71db6103f37eb1b9f184305adb426f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/0d72d41eff71db6103f37eb1b9f184305adb426f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/05629e10f132fca1e08ad9d58088bc471cf4a1ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/05629e10f132fca1e08ad9d58088bc471cf4a1ef","node_id":"C_kwDORt3vE9oAKDA1NjI5ZTEwZjEzMmZjYTFlMDhhZDlkNTgwODhiYzQ3MWNmNGExZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/fa649f5b177dfd472d7657cb0625dbb032577950","sha":"fa649f5b177dfd472d7657cb0625dbb032577950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/fa649f5b177dfd472d7657cb0625dbb032577950"}],"sha":"05629e10f132fca1e08ad9d58088bc471cf4a1ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/comm