d Arce"},"message":"feat: add Codex agent support and unify .agents/skills/ directory (#13)\n\nNew CodexRenderer that serializes MCP config as TOML via go-toml/v2,\noutputs skills to .agents/skills/, and generates AGENTS.md catalog.\n\nAlso unifies Factory and OpenCode skill output to .agents/skills/\n(shared directory) with deduplication in the materializer to prevent\nredundant I/O when multiple agents target the same path.\n\n- agents/codex.yaml: new agent definition\n- renderers/codex.go: full renderer (RenderSkill, RenderMCPs TOML,\n  InstallWorkflow, Finalize with env resolution)\n- materializer.go: renderedSkillDirs dedup + .agents/ gitignore\n- factory.yaml + opencode.yaml: skillDir → .agents/skills/\n- TUI: codex added to agent selection\n- Tests: codex_test.go, golden files, dedup integration test,\n  factory/opencode path assertion updates\n\nCloses #13\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e43e28706ffe716861e0c8db583a3e24fdead7e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/e43e28706ffe716861e0c8db583a3e24fdead7e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/95380aed4d6ab4a589e2374215043207d1d6146c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/rep