gs files:\n- Claude: permissions.allow[] in settings.json\n- OpenCode: permission {} map in opencode.json\n- Copilot: github.copilot.chat.tools.autoApprove[] in .vscode/settings.json\n- Factory: commandAllowlist[]/commandDenylist[] in .factory/settings.json\n\nShared extraction in helpers.go (normalizedMCP.Permissions), per-renderer\ntranslation in RenderSettings(). Settings blocks added to all 4 agent\nYAML definitions to activate generation. 19 new tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e32adcf297b06725f2490deef3de7d0f7c73376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/8e32adcf297b06725f2490deef3de7d0f7c73376"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/7156bfa98878e79c96c9c018362fda433c67f640","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce/DevRune/commit/7156bfa98878e79c96c9c018362fda433c67f640","node_id":"C_kwDORt3vE9oAKDcxNTZiZmE5ODg3OGU3OWM5NmM5