github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/commits/eb5a746d4d158c59f5f68ade35ae72d06c32b881/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T18:47:12Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T18:52:27Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat(tui): add wizard step for developer tool installation via Homebrew\n\nAdd tools as a 5th first-class content type in the catalog system alongside\nskills, rules, mcps, and workflows. The new wizard step discovers tool\ndefinitions from the catalog, detects already-installed binaries via\nexec.LookPath, and installs selected tools in parallel via Homebrew.\n\nKey changes:\n- ToolDef model with conditional activation (depends on selected MCPs/workflows)\n- Parallel brew install with goroutines, huh multi-select, and bubbletea spinner\n- RunResult struct replaces raw *UserManifest return from Run()\n- Dynamic TotalSteps (5 base, 6 with workflow-model step)\n- Fix Bubbletea v2 space key handling: KeyMsg→KeyPressMsg and \" \"→\"space\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6a81d2f25fdba79ea9d83ce870146448196b4ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/c6a81d2f25fdba79ea9d83ce870146448196b4ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/eb5a746d4d158c59f5f68ade35ae72d06c32b881","verification":{"payload