ame":"David Arce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T14:41:37Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"feat: generate unified AGENTS.md at project root with CLAUDE.md symlink\n\nReplace per-agent catalog generation with a single root AGENTS.md as\nthe source of truth for all agents (Claude, OpenCode, Factory, Copilot).\n\nKey changes:\n- New RenderRootCatalog() produces agent-agnostic catalog content\n- WriteManagedBlock/RemoveManagedBlock for marker-based merge that\n  preserves user content outside managed sections\n- CreateSymlinkOrCopy creates CLAUDE.md as symlink (Unix) or copy\n  (Windows) pointing to AGENTS.md\n- Remove RenderCatalog from AgentRenderer interface and all renderers\n- Materializer accumulates skills/rules/workflows across agents with\n  deduplication, generates root catalog after per-agent loop\n- Old workspace catalog files removed during install\n- catalogContributor interface for renderer data collection\n\nCloses #6\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa7d29112e73ad222681e88962fe3e2296ff713d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/aa7d29112e73ad222681e88962fe3e2296ff713d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/a1e4c898cc5f0af358ee8f1d41d81c9380f9e4fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/davidarce","id":13999850,"login":"davidarce","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTk5ODUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davida