6-03-28T16:20:14Z","email":"davidarce2915@gmail.com","name":"David Arce"},"message":"refactor: generalize workflow model/role system beyond SDD\n\nReplace SDD-specific hardcoded placeholder system with a dynamic,\nworkflow-agnostic model/role system. Any workflow can now define roles\nwith models, and DevRune dynamically generates placeholders, shows TUI\nmodel selection, and resolves them per-agent.\n\nKey changes:\n- Rename SDDModelRoutingAgents → ModelRoutingAgents,\n  SDDModelInheritOption → ModelInheritOption (backward-compat aliases kept)\n- Remove SDDPhaseRoleNames and SDDPhaseLabels (TUI reads from workflow)\n- Add PlaceholderKeyFromRole() for dynamic {WORKFLOW_MODEL_<KEY>} derivation\n- Add Placeholder field to WorkflowRole for explicit key overrides\n- Rename SDDModels → WorkflowModels with legacy sddModels YAML migration\n- Rewrite buildWorkflowPlaceholderReplacements to iterate roles dynamically\n- SDD workflows emit both {WORKFLOW_MODEL_*} and legacy {SDD_MODEL_*} aliases\n- removeModelPlaceholderLines now matches both placeholder patterns\n- Rename TUI sdd.go → workflow_models.go with dynamic form building\n- Update materializer, pipeline, confirm, and app to use new names\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8807de365511a9129f5bc412cbbeae1548686cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/trees/8807de365511a9129f5bc412cbbeae1548686cd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/davidarce/DevRune/git/commits/d15967d6c2907cced264eb4ac9010aa2ec377dfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13999850?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/davidarce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/da