hop@gmail.com","name":"jeneratorshop"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T21:04:09Z","email":"jeneratorshop@gmail.com","name":"jeneratorshop"},"message":"Refactor remote app structure and components for improved navigation and authentication\n\n- Removed obsolete route paths and components related to the previous navigation structure.\n- Introduced new components: PreviewHeader and PreviewSidebar for better content management.\n- Updated styles in shell.css to reflect new design requirements.\n- Implemented a new route registry for managing remote routes effectively.\n- Created AuthProvider and RemoteRouteProvider in the host app for handling authentication and route management.\n- Replaced deprecated components in the host app with new implementations for Navbar, Sidebar, and authentication panels.\n- Updated AuthenticationPage and NavigationPage to reflect new content ownership and routing rules.","tree":{"sha":"ca06f46017edab61c5525ed94fa9fc548435eb14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeneratorshop/micro-frontend/git/trees/ca06f46017edab61c5525ed94fa9fc548435eb14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeneratorshop/micro-frontend/git/commits/da2470c908df86e91b7961acfdbe539595a828ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267942831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeneratorshop/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeneratorshop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeneratorshop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeneratorshop/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jeneratorshop","id":267942831,"login":"jeneratorshop","node_id":"U_kgDOD_h7rw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeneratorshop/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jeneratorshop/received_events","repos_