rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/e0b21f7995c3a25cd6abf3e9dd8b1573a28a7269/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T22:32:33Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T22:32:33Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"message":"docs: add active context, decisions, and superpowers specs\n\nData, QA output, lead exports and session logs left untracked and added to .gitignore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d03eaf976cfd2f8a205110bdf500bcb3e2144a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/git/trees/1d03eaf976cfd2f8a205110bdf500bcb3e2144a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/git/commits/e0b21f7995c3a25cd6abf3e9dd8b1573a28a7269","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208879061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bleupreneur","id":208879061,"login":"Bleupreneur","node_id":"U_kgDODHM91Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commit/e0b21f7995c3a25cd6abf3e9dd8b1573a28a7269","node_id":"C_kwDORt9Z1doAKGUwYjIxZjc5OTVjM2EyNWNkNmFiZjNlOWRkOGIxNTczYTI4YTcyNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commit/2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b","sha":"2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b"}],"sha":"e0b21f7995c3a25cd6abf3e9dd8b1573a28a7269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/e0b21f7995c3a25cd6abf3e9dd8b1573a28a7269"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208879061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bleupreneur","id":208879061,"login":"Bleupreneur","node_id":"U_kgDODHM91Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T04:15:49Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T04:15:49Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"message":"feat: 20 demo workflows + edit pipeline + autonomous token extractor\n\nPROOF: programmatic creation of 20 multi-step GHL automations covering 14\ntrigger types and 76 total steps, plus 5 in-place edits, all with before/after\ncanvas screenshots from the live GHL UI.\n\nPipeline added:\n- scripts/create-demo-workflows.ts — builds 20 rich workflows with proper\n  next-chaining, complete trigger configs, and targetActionId wiring\n- scripts/edit-demo-workflows.ts — version-safe PUT-based edits (rename,\n  insert step, append step, mutate config) with before/after step counts\n- scripts/screenshot-workflows.ts — Playwright using dev-browser skill profile\n  to navigate each workflow URL, wait for cross-origin iframe load, capture\n  canvas. Warmup via /location/{loc}/dashboard required for iframe auth.\n- scripts/extract-firebase-token.ts — autonomous refresh-token extractor\n  using dev-browser persistent profile (worked first try, no manual login)\n- scripts/rotate-token.ts — full Playwright login + wrangler push + worker\n  verify. Currently OTP-blocked; documented two fixes in script header.\n\nInfrastructure:\n- .env scaffolding (gitignored, chmod 600) for project-scoped credentials\n- Worker /cli/token verified end-to-end via Skool!@90! ADMIN_PIN\n- ghl-api.ts corrected: /workflow/{loc}/{wfId} (no /steps phantom path)\n\nArtifacts:\n- analysis/demos/workflows.json — 20 workflow IDs + URLs\n- analysis/demos/edits.json     — 5 applied edits with before/after counts\n- analysis/demos/screenshots/   — 20 canvas captures\n- analysis/demos/screenshots-after/ — 5 post-edit captures\n- analysis/login-debug/        — OTP screen evidence (proves rotation\n  pipeline works through every step except the email-OTP wall)\n- PROOF.md                     — full inventory + verification instructions\n\nToken rotation status:\nThe currently-deployed Firebase refresh token is valid and was used for the\nentire 20-workflow + 5-edit + 25-screenshot run. Firebase refresh tokens\npersist until explicit revocation, so rotation is only needed when the worker\nstarts returning 401s. When that happens, either disable email OTP in the\nbleupreneur GHL account (1 minute) or generate a Gmail app password to\nenable IMAP polling for the OTP code (15 min build).","tree":{"sha":"7972d2496e364435e55633308abfe3d8aebfa43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/git/trees/7972d2496e364435e55633308abfe3d8aebfa43e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/git/commits/2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208879061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bleupreneur","id":208879061,"login":"Bleupreneur","node_id":"U_kgDODHM91Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commit/2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b","node_id":"C_kwDORt9Z1doAKDI1MzFiODY2NDlkZTNiM2VjMTMzNWE0ZmZlNzVkNWY1MzI0ZDFkOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commit/44830b0e73ff55b238ea433dfe6c5fef1dab0fba","sha":"44830b0e73ff55b238ea433dfe6c5fef1dab0fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/44830b0e73ff55b238ea433dfe6c5fef1dab0fba"}],"sha":"2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/2531b86649de3b3ec1335a4ffe75d5f5324d1d9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208879061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Bleupreneur","id":208879061,"login":"Bleupreneur","node_id":"U_kgDODHM91Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/44830b0e73ff55b238ea433dfe6c5fef1dab0fba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-20T02:22:20Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-20T02:22:20Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"message":"feat: probing harness + 99 verified action/trigger schemas\n\nBuilds an end-to-end pipeline that drives GHL workflow API via the\nghl-workflow-builder-mcp Cloudflare Worker (auth via /cli/token), creates\nthrowaway workflows for each type, diffs sent vs Firebase-doc-returned\nto discover server defaults, and bakes results back into templates/.\n\nResults from this run:\n- 54/56 actions round-trip clean (find_opportunity + goto reject save)\n- 45/45 triggers accepted (incl. previously untested ivr_incoming_call)\n- 11 TBD action schemas resolved (drip, conversation_ai, slack_message,\n  math/text/number/datetime_formatter, array_functions, ivr_*, stripe)\n- All templates updated with attributes_schema + provenance + mining_notes\n\nHarness components:\n- scripts/lib/auth.ts          — fetches JWT from worker /cli/token\n- scripts/lib/ghl-api.ts       — internal REST client (correct endpoints)\n- scripts/extract-firebase-token.ts — autonomous refresh-token extractor\n                                       via dev-browser skill profile\n- scripts/probe-actions.ts     — create→save→diff per action type\n- scripts/probe-triggers.ts    — create→post→read per trigger type\n- scripts/synthesize-schemas.ts — merges probe+capture+bundle into templates\n- scripts/mine-bundle.ts       — workflow builder v2 source-map miner\n- scripts/capture-via-cdp.ts   — CDP-attach Playwright UI capture\n- scripts/gen-trigger-stubs.ts — bootstraps templates/triggers/ from doc\n\nCodex review applied: try/finally cleanup, hard-fail on missing version,\nJSON-pointer diff paths, dedup''d source provenance, full-template\npreservation, trigger iteration in synthesizer.","tree":{"sha":"0d5d7c3150443329c0130dce6033d6f46c767fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/git/trees/0d5d7c3150443329c0130dce6033d6f46c767fde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder