https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bleupreneur","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-builder/commits/0058b9161474d7581fbbb73d3ccb54a5b824a3b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T16:23:36Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T16:23:36Z","email":"bleusparkmarketing@gmail.com","name":"Bleusparkfix"},"message":"feat: complete trigger type registry — 54 types with correct API values\n\nMajor discovery: 29 of 54 trigger type strings were WRONG.\nThe trigger API accepts any string without validation, so wrong types\nwere silently stored but the GHL UI couldn''t render them.\n\nKey corrections:\n- form_submitted -> form_submission\n- contact_dnd -> dnd_contact\n- customer_replied -> customer_reply\n- survey_submitted -> survey_submission\n- appointment_status -> appointment\n- note_added -> note_add\n- pipeline_stage_changed -> pipeline_stage_updated\n- stale_opportunity -> opportunity_decay\n- membership_new_signup -> membership_contact_created\n- + 20 more corrections\n\nAlso documents:\n- Required condition schemas per trigger type\n- Which triggers work without conditions\n- Which triggers REQUIRE specific conditions (form.id, calendar.id, etc.)\n- Action dependencies (respond_on_comment needs comment trigger, etc.)\n\nSource: Extracted from GHL workflow builder JS bundle at\nclient-app-automation-workflows.leadconnectorhq.com","tree":{"sha":"be6f05347cd261b28c76a45358f7dabb71e31948","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/drleadflow/ghl-automation-build