"2026-03-25T07:12:38Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: add adaptive learning engine (Horizon 1)\n\nStructured event stream (StudyEvent types) instrumented via Redux\nmiddleware to capture card reviews, scenario decisions, and completions.\nPerformance model uses EWMA per-term accuracy and recency-weighted\ncategory strength. Adaptive recommender scores scenarios by category\nweakness, term gaps, difficulty match, and freshness.\n\n- Event persistence in localStorage (5000-event cap)\n- ScenarioSelector shows \"Recommended for You\" section\n- ProgressPanel shows blended mastery, focus areas, and weak terms\n- 16 tests covering performance model and adaptive scoring\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbf0cddec0f24bb0e8f16f989c985de88da63f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/seh-study/git/trees/bbf0cddec0f24bb0e8f16f989c985de88da63f11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/seh-study/git/commits/80170994a00cbc08c3123c7bf1ccfe613b6e4829","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type