rs/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/seh-study/commits/9a3183cf5ceadcaa17d3d52cdef41443998e9f6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:07:42Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:07:42Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: implement glossary, SR engine, Study/Browse/Progress panels\n\n- Copy 238-term NASA SEH glossary into shared package\n- Auto-classify terms into 10 categories (categories.ts)\n- Leitner 5-box SR engine with promote/demote/getDueCards/getStudyDeck\n- StudyPanel: flashcard flip + quiz (4-option multiple choice) modes\n  with category filtering, session tracking, box tags\n- BrowsePanel: full-text search + category accordion with box badges\n- ProgressPanel: mastery %, box distribution bars, category mastery grid\n- studySlice: Redux state with localStorage persistence for cards/sessions\n- 15 tests passing (5 types + 10 SR engine)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d44b657487898de46521635c35d3e8af22a1676d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/seh-study/git/trees/d44b657487898de46521635c35d3e8af22a1676d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/seh-study/git/commits/9a3183cf5ceadcaa17d3d52cdef41443998e9f6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gi