ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T14:02:30Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"feat: rich MDR case detail — full investigation story\n\nCase Detail now includes:\n\nACTIVITIES (14 entries):\n- Auto-created case from detection\n- MDR escalation and priority assignment\n- Initial triage with C2 confirmation\n- Threat hunting across all endpoints\n- Lateral movement detected and blocked\n- Device isolation via API\n- CryptoGuard blocks ransomware\n- Firewall rule deployed for C2 IP\n- Credential compromise identified\n- Full malware analysis with artifacts\n- Persistence cleanup\n- Endpoint scan all-clear\n- Incident report delivered\n- Status update: containment\n\nMITRE ATT&CK (8 tactics, 10 techniques):\nTA0001 Initial Access → T1566.001 Spearphishing\nTA0002 Execution → T1059.001 PowerShell, T1204.002 Malicious File\nTA0003 Persistence → T1053.005 Scheduled Task\nTA0005 Defense Evasion → T1562.001 Disable Tools\nTA0006 Credential Access → T1003.001 LSASS Memory\nTA0008 Lateral Movement → T1021.002 SMB Admin Shares\nTA0011 C2 → T1071.001 Web Protocols\nTA0040 Impact → T1486 Data Encrypted, T1490 Inhibit Recovery\n\nIMPACTED ENTITIES:\n- DESKTOP-FIN042 (5 detections)\n- SRV-FS01 (1 detection — lateral movement)\n- 185.220.101.47 (C2 IP)\n- sarah.chen (targeted user)\n\nNOTEBOOK (4 investigation sections):\n1. Executive Summary — dwell time, impact, status\n2. Attack Timeline — minute-by-minute kill chain\n3. Recommendations — immediate/short/long-term actions\n4. IOCs — file hashes, C2 config, persistence artifacts, credentials","tree":{"sha":"2249447138b87c4e2ab03989e7e794afb9233d1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/2249447138b87c4e2ab03989e7e794afb9233d1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/470cca48ce677e099f278d4f2c7cdbb66ad05e64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"co