/api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/43deee02fba6a6d424345bf245d816e3d4d85a87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T03:00:58Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T03:00:58Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"feat: streaming generation (SSE) + scenario sharing via URL\n\nSTREAMING (#6):\n- Added generateStream() to llm.mjs — async iterator yielding text chunks\n- Pi SDK, Anthropic, and OpenAI providers all support native streaming\n- Local LLM falls back to single-chunk (non-streaming)\n- New /api/stream SSE endpoint handles demo-script, battle-card, follow-up\n- Frontend streamGenerate() helper reads SSE and updates DOM in real-time\n- All 3 generation buttons (Demo Script, Battle Card, Follow-Up) now stream\n- Text appears word-by-word instead of waiting 10-15s for full response\n\nSHARING (#7):\n- Share button (🔗) base64-encodes scenario JSON into a URL\n- Opening a ?share=... URL auto-imports the scenario, shows result panel,\n  fills form fields from customer data, and shows a toast notification\n- URL is cleaned from address bar after import (history.replaceState)\n- Size guard: warns if scenario exceeds 100KB URL length\n\nFIXES:\n- Static file handler now strips query strings before resolving paths\n  (fixes 404 on /?share=... and /?remix=... URLs)","tree":{"sha":"0b68a828530fca2026d56bde3e1ae9b87f64c9d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injecto