der Threat scenarios (#1, #9 partial)\n\nMDR Scenario (mdr.json — 20KB):\n- Full MDR response story: 2am detection → 8 min containment → morning report\n- 5 alerts: CryptoGuard block, C2 beacon, lateral movement blocked, initial phishing, remediation complete\n- Case: managedBy ''mtr'', status ''containment'', detailed MDR timeline in overview\n- 8 case activities showing MDR team actions minute-by-minute\n- 3 detections: spearphishing macro, Cobalt Strike C2, shadow copy deletion\n- 6 audit logs: device isolation, lateral movement block, firewall rule, cred reset, remediation, report delivery\n- Live Discover: MDR threat hunt query with 5 IOC results\n- Threat graph with beacon process tree\n\nInsider Threat Scenario (insider.json — 13KB):\n- Disgruntled IT admin exfiltrating data: off-hours VPN, bulk DB export, USB copy, cloud upload\n- 4 alerts: cloud exfil (3.2GB Dropbox), USB violation, DB query anomaly, off-hours access\n- Case: behavioral investigation with MITRE T1567.002 (cloud exfil), T1052.001 (USB), T1119 (collection)\n- 4 case activities tracking the exfiltration timeline\n- 2 detections: bulk database query, cloud upload\n- 3 audit logs: VPN login, USB device, cloud upload\n- Live Discover: file activity query showing 5 large files touched by the user\n\nStill to build: supply chain, BEC, zero-day scenarios + features #2-8, #10","tree":{"sha":"3a835d31f65b49a247cab879103ee54914b6911d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/3a835d31f65b49a247cab879103ee54914b6911d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/cf1b091e39cf9295100b75cf3e865ebb8eba7c7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://