ent_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T01:40:26Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"Sophos-branded intake site + comprehensive README + testing plan\n\nIntake site redesign:\n- Authentic Sophos Central styling (dark navy topbar, Source Sans 3 font,\n  white section cards with light header bars, blue accent palette)\n- Shield logo + ''SOPHOS'' wordmark + ''INTERNAL TOOL'' badge\n- Scenario type cards with checkmark indicator on selection\n- Product focus chips (toggle on/off with blue highlight)\n- Clean stats row for generated scenario results\n- Dark-themed JSON preview with JetBrains Mono\n- Responsive grid layout for mobile/tablet\n- No generic AI aesthetic — matches Sophos product design language\n\nREADME.md (36KB):\n- Why This Exists + How It Works (technical deep dive)\n- Step-by-step Installation guide\n- Quick Start walkthrough\n- All 4 built-in scenarios with demo talking points\n- Custom Scenarios (import/export/paste)\n- AI Scenario Generator setup + usage + tips\n- Demo Walkthroughs: MDR (20min), Endpoint Protection (15min), Email Security (15min)\n- Best Practice Tips (before/during/after demo)\n- Full endpoint override reference table\n- Known Caveats with workarounds\n- Troubleshooting guide (10 common issues)\n- Customizing Scenarios (templates, timestamps, auto-generation)\n- Architecture Deep Dive (component diagram, MAIN world, scenario loading flow)\n- Distribution options (repo, zip, Chrome Enterprise, Web Store)\n- Roadmap\n\nTESTING.md (27KB):\n- 10-phase testing plan with checkboxes\n- Phase 1: Extension loading (4 sections)\n- Phase 2: Basic functionality (toggle, names, write blocking, logging)\n- Phase 3-6: Each scenario tested across all pages\n- Phase 7: Import/export/delete workflows\n- Phase 8: AI scenario generator end-to-end\n- Phase 9: Edge cases (multi-tab, SPA nav, rapid toggle, long session)\n- Phase 10: Screenshot list for documentation\n- Bug report template\n- Test results log table\n\nAlso: phishing scenario now has cases + detections (was empty)","tree":{"sha":"58a49a640b3deea53e0440c12cd577eb13820f0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/58a49a640b3deea53e0440c12cd577eb13820f0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/20738c9847e72d6318f1bfb9d52f25a96d0dc4b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/20738c9847e72d6318f1bfb9d52f25a96d0dc4b7","node_id":"C_kwDORuBid9oAKDIwNzM4Yzk4NDdlNzJkNjMxOGYxYmZiOWQ1MmYyNWE5NmQwZGM0Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382","sha":"63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382"}],"sha":"20738c9847e72d6318f1bfb9d52f25a96d0dc4b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/20738c9847e72d6318f1bfb9d52f25a96d0dc4b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T01:24:03Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T01:24:03Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"Build items 1-5: device lists, dashboard, threat graphs, device detail\n\n#1-2 Device/Server lists:\n- Expanded URL pattern matching for device list APIs\n- Added catch-all heuristic: any response with items[] that look like\n  devices (has hostname, health_status, last_activity) gets overridden\n- This should catch the micro-frontend''s device list regardless of\n  the exact API endpoint it uses\n\n#3 Dashboard widgets:\n- Dashboard widgets (alerts_recent, xdr_recent_cases, health_summary)\n  already pull from APIs we intercept (alerts, cases, health scores)\n- The dashboard config (/dashboard-manager/v2/dashboards) passes\n  through unmodified — widgets render correctly with our fake data\n\n#4 Threat graph visualization:\n- generateThreatGraph() builds graph nodes/edges from detection data\n- Auto-creates process tree: parent → child process → network (C2) → file\n- Marks nodes as malicious/suspicious based on risk score\n- Extracts C2 IPs from command lines for network nodes\n- generateThreatArtifacts() builds artifact list from detections\n- Falls back to auto-generation when no explicit graph data in scenario\n\n#5 Device detail:\n- generateDeviceDetail() creates full device object (OS, IP, MAC,\n  tamper protection, encryption, assigned products, health status)\n- Matches device to detection data by hostname for realistic enrichment\n- Interceptor catches /endpoints/{id}, /computers/{id}, /devices/{id}\n- Merges fake data with real response when device matches a detection","tree":{"sha":"5600c2efe745aec696a80cc5da1b2bb2e7681bd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/5600c2efe745aec696a80cc5da1b2bb2e7681bd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382","node_id":"C_kwDORuBid9oAKDYzZTI5YTgwZTAxZDk5MDdmODVmYmQwNjE4YjBjNDg3YjNhZGMzODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/0f50e2bfe87bee527f9d229862bf9d3705e71d3d","sha":"0f50e2bfe87bee527f9d229862bf9d3705e71d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/0f50e2bfe87bee527f9d229862bf9d3705e71d3d"}],"sha":"63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/63e29a80e01d9907f85fbd0618b0c487b3adc382"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/0f50e2bfe87bee527f9d229862bf9d3705e71d3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T01:20:22Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T01:20:22Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"Add audit logs, Live Discover, and email history interceptors (#6-8)\n\nNew interceptors:\n- Audit logs: /api/audit/logs, /api/logs/audit — prepend or override\n  with fake admin actions (device isolation, credential reset, firewall rules)\n- Live Discover: /live-discover/, /xdr-query/, /osquery/ —\n  query results with columns/rows, saved queries catalog, connected endpoints\n- Email history: /email/messages, /email/quarantine, message detail —\n  message search results, quarantine list, individual message trace\n\nUpdated scenarios:\n- ransomware.json: 4 audit log entries (isolation, cleanup, CryptoGuard, tamper protection)\n  + Live Discover query results (shadow copy & PowerShell processes on DESKTOP-FIN042)\n- xdr.json: 5 audit log entries (3 host isolations, credential reset, firewall rule)\n  + Live Discover query (lateral movement & credential theft across 3 hosts)\n- phishing.json: 3 audit log entries (campaign blocked, post-delivery remediation, endpoint block)\n  + Email history with 5 sample messages (blocked/quarantined/delivered)\n  + Quarantine list with 3 items including post-delivery clawback\n\nUpdated SCHEMA.md with auditLogs, liveDiscover, emailHistory documentation.\nUpdated intake-site prompt to generate all new sections.","tree":{"sha":"82466d4c9dee57bafa2da2c5976f3f981339a6aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/82466d4c9dee57bafa2da2c5976f3f981339a6aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/0f50e2bfe87bee527f9d229862bf9d3705e71d3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://