ar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/06b9e09c63ccc55b83140aecf94de6b9c47cfa17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:57:31Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:57:31Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"Phase 2: Demo Scenario Intake Website\n\nAI-powered scenario builder for Sales Engineers:\n\n- Web form captures: customer details, industry, scenario type,\n  threat actor, entry point, MDR involvement, custom story,\n  demo focus, competitor comparison\n- Backend uses Pi SDK with OAuth (auto-refresh tokens) to call\n  Claude Sonnet 4 for scenario generation\n- System prompt includes full schema reference + 2 example\n  scenarios + industry-specific guidance + MITRE ATT&CK reference\n- Generated scenarios match exact API shapes for the Chrome extension\n- Frontend: Sophos-branded form with DM Sans typography, scenario\n  type cards, checkbox grid, JSON preview with stats summary\n- Copy JSON / Download .json buttons for easy import into extension\n\nStack: Node.js HTTP server + Pi SDK (createAgentSession)\nPort: 3847\n\nUsage:\n  cd intake-site\n  npm link @mariozechner/pi-coding-agent\n  npm start\n  → http://localhost:3847","tree":{"sha":"0ef69b08cb4121d5e3a129b555b21a7929961579","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/