s{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/b25f82fd08588f57ec5ebeeb5507e7efe30da9ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:15:48Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:15:48Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"Phase 1: Refactor to JSON-driven scenarios with import/export\n\n- Extracted 4 hardcoded scenarios into external JSON files:\n  ransomware.json, healthy.json, phishing.json, xdr.json\n- Built template engine for scenario JSON:\n  - {{customerName}}, {{endpointCount}}, {{endpointCount * 0.85}}\n  - Relative timestamps: -3m, -2h, -1d, now\n  - Auto-generated UUIDs and IDs\n- Rewrote interceptor.js to load scenarios from resolved JSON\n- Rewrote service-worker.js with scenario registry:\n  - LIST_SCENARIOS, IMPORT_SCENARIO, DELETE_SCENARIO, EXPORT_SCENARIO\n  - Preloads built-in scenarios, caches custom scenarios in chrome.storage\n- Rebuilt popup with import/export UI:\n  - Import via paste JSON or file picker\n  - Export current scenario as .json download\n  - Delete custom scenarios\n  - Grouped dropdown (Built-in / Custom)\n  - Auto-loads customer defaults when switching custom scenarios\n- Added SCHEMA.md documenting the scenario JSON format\n- Added scenarios/ to web_accessible_resources in manifest\n- Bumped version to 1.1.0\n\nFoundation for Phase 2: AI-powered scenario intake website","tree":{"sha":"98d7e761b03a015b67460c750f663806506d0ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/98d7e761b03a015b67460c750f663806506d0ad4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/b25f82fd08588f57ec5ebeeb5507e7efe30da9ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/b25f82fd08588f57ec5ebeeb5507e7efe30da9ef","node_id":"C_kwDORuBid9oAKGIyNWY4MmZkMDg1ODhmNTdlYzVlYmVlYjU1MDdlN2VmZTMwZGE5ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/7a433da9359903b940128a82bf70b75e5504bb57","sha":"7a433da9359903b940128a82bf70b75e5504bb57","url":"