n- Chrome extension architecture diagram\n- Extension file structure\n- Content script approach (fetch/XHR override)\n- Popup UI mockup (scenario picker + customer name)\n- Sophos domains to intercept vs pass through\n- Distribution options (crx, Chrome Web Store, enterprise policy)\n- Updated build plan (5 phases, 4-5 hours)\n- Session checklist for build day","tree":{"sha":"fca54503ae719c80cfae0c90a9d392773d8e17e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/fca54503ae719c80cfae0c90a9d392773d8e17e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/7a433da9359903b940128a82bf70b75e5504bb57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/7a433da9359903b940128a82bf70b75e5504bb57","node_id":"C_kwDORuBid9oAKDdhNDMzZGE5MzU5OTAzYjk0MDEyOGE4MmJmNzBiNzVlNTUwNGJiNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/319db61b34c6e9f71f2f9b47f7acfe9a0180bf23","sha":"319db61b34c6e9f71f2f9b47f7acfe9a0180bf23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/319db61b34c6e9f71f2f9b47f7acfe9a0180bf23"}],"sha":"7a433da9359903b940128a82bf70b75e5504bb57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/7a433da9359903b940128a82bf70b75e5504bb57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commits/319db61b34c6e9f71f2f9b47f7acfe9a0180bf23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:57:02Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T01:57:02Z","email":"jasoaco79@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jasoaco79"},"message":"API discovery script + detailed build gameplan\n\nscripts/discover-apis.mjs:\n  - Connects to existing Chrome via CDP (port 9222)\n  - Navigates 13 Sophos Central pages\n  - Captures every API call (URL, method, status, response shape, sample data)\n  - Screenshots each page\n  - Outputs: api-discovery.json, api-summary.json, interceptable-endpoints.json\n\nGAMEPLAN.md — 5-phase build plan:\n  Phase 1: API Discovery (15 min) — run script, map all endpoints\n  Phase 2: Build Proxy (30 min) — mitmproxy interceptor + scenario configs\n  Phase 3: Demo Scenarios (45 min) — ransomware, healthy, phishing, XDR\n  Phase 4: CLI + Browser Setup (20 min) — PAC file, cert install, start script\n  Phase 5: Polish (15 min) — test, tune timestamps, verify pagination\n\nPrerequisite: Chrome on grimstarr must be logged into Sophos Central.\nEstimated total build time: 2-3 hours.","tree":{"sha":"685d38fb4243fc2647ba0ed232679a0a919ed4c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/trees/685d38fb4243fc2647ba0ed232679a0a919ed4c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasoaco79/demo-injector/git/commits/319db61b34c6e9f71f2f9b47f7acfe9a0180bf23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260302728?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79","id":260302728,"login":"jasoaco79","node_id":"U_kgDOD4PniA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasoaco79","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jasoaco79/demo-injector/commit/319db61b34c6e9f71f2f9b47f7acfe9a0180bf23","node_id":"C_kwDORuB