/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/9ade2e7d0af3ae6125761f60a7fd0be826b77884/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T04:56:43Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T04:56:43Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"fix(pi-install): hard-fail when frontend/dist/index.html is missing\n\nDesktop PRD \\xc2\\xa723 requires a reproducible Pi install from a fresh\ncheckout. Previously, install.sh only mentioned the missing build as\na post-install warning; an operator could complete the install and\nreboot into ''Could not load the frontend'' with no upfront signal.\n\n- Add an explicit check after the .venv and .env prereqs\n- On failure, print the exact ''cd frontend && npm install && npm run build''\n  command and exit 1 before any files are written\n- Remove the now-redundant trailing build warning","tree":{"sha":"86a3310362a66bc178369beaad51e6d182567a06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/86a3310362a66bc178369beaad51e6d182567a06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/9ade2e7d0af3ae6125761f60a7fd0be826b77884","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axel