d WA_NativeWindow close button (✕) overlaid top-right corner,\n  gated on DEV_QUIT_ENABLED; repositioned in resizeEvent; z-order confirmed on Pi\n- pi_start.sh: enable FLASHPOINT_DEV_QUIT=1 (was 0); add flock guard on\n  /tmp/flashpoint-shell.lock to prevent duplicate shell instances\n- deploy/pi/Flashpoint-launcher.desktop: new template for ~/Desktop icon;\n  same pi_start.sh exec path, flock guard handles click-while-running\n- deploy/pi/install.sh: install ~/Desktop/Flashpoint.desktop with chmod +x\n- deploy/pi/README.md: document quit mechanisms, desktop icon, uninstall step\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d1ed074e7748787ae26d387f349fe06deb73023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/8d1ed074e7748787ae26d387f349fe06deb73023"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/8774e6ff4243de2efbab3ef9695299d8b38cb96d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"U