xelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T17:02:05Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"fix: migrate Pi Qt binding from PyQt5 to PyQt6 to fix boot frontend load failure\n\nRPi 5 kernels use 16KB memory pages. Qt5 WebEngine''s embedded Chromium 87\nhardcodes 4KB page assumptions in PartitionAlloc; the renderer subprocess\ncrashes on boot with a fatal mmap EINVAL regardless of QTWEBENGINE_CHROMIUM_FLAGS.\nThe prior fix (commit 55b57d7) correctly identified and disabled the GPU process\nbut could not resolve the allocator crash.\n\nQt6 WebEngine 6.4.2 from Debian Bookworm is built with 16KB page support and\nloads the frontend successfully (confirmed loadFinished=True on Pi 5 hardware).\n\nChanges:\n- qt_compat.py: try PyQt6 first, then PySide6 (Mac), then PyQt5 (legacy fallback)\n- window.py: fully-qualified enum paths (Qt.AlignmentFlag.*, Qt.WindowType.*,\n  Qt.ContextMenuPolicy.*) required by PyQt6 strict enum scoping; compatible with\n  PySide6 and PyQt5 5.15+\n- deploy/pi/README.md, install.sh, pi_fix_qt_runtime.sh, CLAUDE.md: update all\n  Pi setup instructions from python3-pyqt5 to python3-pyqt6\n\nPi setup (new): sudo apt install python3-pyqt6 python3-pyqt6.qtwebengine\nExisting Pi venvs: bash scripts/pi_fix_qt_runtime.sh\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dcb9616789b4e1f3661c98cb03552c339d9da32b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/dcb9616789b4e1f3661c98cb03552c339d9da32b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/33e08b9454bf2ab41ad9ec871c47d5956df80cea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/33e08b9454bf2ab41ad9ec871c47d5956df80cea","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDMzZTA4Yjk0NTRiZjJhYjQxYWQ5ZWM4NzFjNDdkNTk1NmRmODBjZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/28d5962b3cc6e7f4014c4eceb493045e1607a610","sha":"28d5962b3cc6e7f4014c4eceb493045e1607a610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/28d5962b3cc6e7f4014c4eceb493045e1607a610"}],"sha":"33e08b9454bf2ab41ad9ec871c47d5956df80cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/33e08b9454bf2ab41ad9ec871c47d5956df80cea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"ht