","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/f70c3e23270d6aba7d60c7d57936cbee7ae813bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T06:35:35Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T06:35:35Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: enable conservative Event Registry discovery and validation\n\n- Fix silent failure: ER API returns HTTP 200 with {\"error\":\"...\"} when\n  keyword limit exceeded; add explicit error check before parsing articles\n- Fix keyword query: OR operators count toward free-tier limit (29 words\n  exceeded the 15-word cap); reduce to single high-recall keyword \"protest\"\n- Fix zero-article output: ER free API omits lat/lon from article location\n  objects; add US state centroid fallback table so state-tagged articles\n  resolve to usable coordinates (precision=\"state\")\n- .env settings changed (not committed): EVENT_REGISTRY_MIN_LOCATION_PRECISION=state,\n  EVENT_REGISTRY_CREATE_NEW_EVENTS=true — validated live: 6 events created,\n  1 corroborated in first run; titles are relevant US protest/unrest articles\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ccf7c3624fe4a883753166f6f648c1ed0195db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/1ccf7c3624fe4a883753166f6f648c1ed0195db0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/f70c3e23270d6aba7d60c7d57936cbee7ae813bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_