er_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/b937e2d17219935c7a0ce143b8e6a9ccc7dc960d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T06:35:24Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T06:35:24Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"fix: improve time handling and hotspot clustering quality\n\n- Fix negative-age display bug: shared parseUTC() appends Z to naive UTC\n  strings before JS Date parsing; relativeTime() clamps negative diffs to 0\n- Reduce cluster radius 150→75 miles (Seattle-Portland now correctly separate)\n- Add 72-hour clustering time window; stale events excluded without mutating is_active\n- Exclude state-level events from Pass 1 clustering to prevent state-centroid\n  events (e.g. California centroid near Chowchilla) from inflating city-level clusters\n- Fix trend zero-baseline bias: require r_count>=2 before escalating can trigger\n- Parse ActionGeo_Type from GDELT to populate location_precision on new events\n- Add 16-test suite covering radius, centroid stability, MIN_EVENTS, trend cases,\n  momentum decay\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09