Flashpoint/commits/b937e2d17219935c7a0ce143b8e6a9ccc7dc960d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/647d7b61016f1207ba07d4141d08933e5819ff0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T02:03:11Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T02:03:11Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: add Event Registry as supplementary ingestion source\n\nAdds Event Registry alongside GDELT/mock as a second ingestion source,\nrunning on its own scheduler cadence. Focuses on corroboration first\n(enriching existing events with additional source evidence) and optionally\ndiscovering new events when enabled.\n\nKey components:\n- Deterministic classifier (title + body + ER categories + concepts) with\n  hard exclusions for opinion, weather-only, and accident content\n- Cross-source deduplication: haversine + time window + Jaccard similarity\n- Six-rule syndicated copy detection (wire families, title similarity,\n  URL domain, timestamp proximity, ER eventUri) — suppresses fake corroboration\n- Tiered uncorroborated confidence caps: venue 0.62 / city 0.58 / state 0.45\n- EventSource provenance table storing per-article evidence with trust weights\n- source_count semantics: independent sources only; syndicated copies stored\n  at weight=0.0 with no confidence uplift\n- EventDetailOut API response with embedded sources list\n- Frontend lazy-fetches event detail on selection; DetailPane shows source\n  evidence section with outlet, title link, relative time, and [SYNDICATED] tag\n- 71 new tests across 4 files; 90 total passing","tree":{"sha":"5102a8ebbc737781140c941cfeac12c2db9cfbab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/5102a8ebbc737781140c941cfeac12c2db9cfbab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/647d7b61016f1207ba07d4141d08933e5819ff0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/647d7b61016f1207ba07d4141d08933e5819ff0d","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDY0N2Q3YjYxMDE2ZjEyMDdiYTA3ZDQxNDFkMDg5MzNlNTgxOWZmMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92","sha":"55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92"}],"sha":"647d7b61016f1207ba07d4141d08933e5819ff0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/647d7b61016f1207ba07d4141d08933e5819ff0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T23:28:13Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-26T23:28:13Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"fix: resolve Pi shell frontend load failure\n\nSets QTWEBENGINE_DISABLE_SANDBOX and QTWEBENGINE_CHROMIUM_FLAGS in\npi_start.sh so the QtWebEngine Chromium subprocess disables GPU\ncompositing and its sandbox on Raspberry Pi OS Bookworm. Without\n--disable-gpu, the Chromium GPU process fails to initialize against\nVideoCore VII, causing loadFinished(false) even though curl returns 200.\n\nAdds diagnostic logging to window.py (load lifecycle + renderer\nprocess termination signal) so any remaining failure mode is\nvisible in terminal output rather than a silent black-box failure.","tree":{"sha":"41d99d98b864b3f5741d3c3b8825af839bdf673b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/41d99d98b864b3f5741d3c3b8825af839bdf673b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDU1YjU3ZDdjOGFkMDRhNjk1ODc2YzMyMzgxNWE1NGM4NjU1ZTVjOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947","sha":"112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947"}],"sha":"55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/55b57d7c8ad04a695876c323815a54c8655e5c92"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T23:07:49Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T23:07:49Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"chore: add Pi Qt runtime migration script\n\nAdds scripts/pi_fix_qt_runtime.sh to automate the PyQt5 migration on Pi:\ninstalls system Qt packages, recreates the venv with --system-site-packages,\nreinstalls backend deps, and verifies the Qt compat layer. Adds pointers\nto the script in deploy/pi/README.md and desktop/README.md.","tree":{"sha":"31e509ec2cca00e1f99c59889e1c9bf42f5f1a37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/31e509ec2cca00e1f99c59889e1c9bf42f5f1a37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDExMmM0ZTczYmQxNWM5NmFjYTNkOGU1NjZjZmUxZjdiNjE3NmY5NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933","sha":"43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933"}],"sha":"112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/112c4e73bd15c96aca3d8e566cfe1f7b6176f947"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T22:39:45Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T22:39:45Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"fix: make desktop shell Pi-compatible on Raspberry Pi OS\n\npip-installed PySide6 wheels on aarch64 link against libwebp.so.6\nbut Raspberry Pi OS Bookworm provides libwebp.so.7. The shell fails\nto import PySide6.QtWebEngineWidgets at startup.\n\nFix: use system-native PyQt5 on Pi (python3-pyqt5 + python3-pyqt5.\nqtwebengine via apt, always available on Bookworm arm64) while keeping\npip-installed PySide6 for Mac development.\n\nA new compatibility layer (desktop/app/qt_compat.py) tries PySide6\nfirst and falls back to PyQt5. All shell code now imports Qt symbols\nfrom qt_compat instead of PySide6 directly. Enum references in\nwindow.py are changed to short-form style (Qt.AlignCenter vs\nQt.AlignmentFlag.AlignCenter), which works in both bindings.\n\nPi venv must be created with --system-site-packages to see the\nsystem PyQt5. Existing venvs from the PySide6 path must be deleted\nand recreated — documented as a hard requirement in deploy/pi/README.md.\n\nMac-validated: qt_compat imports resolve correctly, enum values match,\nPySide6 path is selected. Pi validation requires hardware testing.","tree":{"sha":"07ef2cccc67c22eab44c8fd5ac77bb8f9166eb9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/07ef2cccc67c22eab44c8fd5ac77bb8f9166eb9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDQzZGJiN2YzY2E4OGY2YjBhMGYyMzVkY2ExMzRhZGFkZjdlNzI5MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f","sha":"66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f"}],"sha":"43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/43dbb7f3ca88f6b0a0f235dca134adadf7e72933"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T19:48:15Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T19:48:15Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: add Pi frontend delivery path\n\nBackend now serves frontend/dist/ via FastAPI StaticFiles at ''/''.\npi_start.sh sets FLASHPOINT_FRONTEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000 so the\nshell loads the built frontend from the same backend process — no Vite\ndev server required on Pi.\n\nMount is conditional: if frontend/dist/ is missing at startup the backend\nlogs a warning and continues serving the API. Shell shows the existing\n''Could not load the frontend'' state until the build is present and the\nbackend restarted.\n\nMac-validated: / → 200 HTML, /api/v1/* → JSON, static assets → 200.\nPi hardware validation remains a separate step.\n\nAlso fixes deploy/pi/README.md install command (pip install -e . not\nthe non-existent backend/requirements.txt) and documents the one-time\nfrontend build prerequisite for Pi setup.","tree":{"sha":"baddc153241ddde43c328414d97a37fc3bb147d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/baddc153241ddde43c328414d97a37fc3bb147d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDY2ZDAxMGZmOWY0NTZiNTgyYjFjNjY2MDFkMTcwZTUwMDM3MTliM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906","sha":"4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906"}],"sha":"66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/66d010ff9f456b582b1c66601d170e5003719b3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T06:34:40Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T06:34:40Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: add Pi autostart and service scaffolding\n\nCreates deploy/pi/ with repo-owned Pi runtime artifacts:\n  - flashpoint-backend.service — systemd user service template\n    (uvicorn on 127.0.0.1:8000, Type=simple, Restart=on-failure)\n  - flashpoint.desktop — XDG autostart template (portable across WMs)\n  - install.sh — install helper (sed substitution, --dry-run support)\n  - README.md — setup guide with boot flow, prerequisites, known gaps\n\nAdds scripts/pi_start.sh — Pi shell launcher that sets\nFLASHPOINT_MANAGED=1, FLASHPOINT_FULLSCREEN=1, FLASHPOINT_DEV_QUIT=0,\nand FLASHPOINT_BACKEND_HEALTH_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health\n(explicit IPv4 — avoids localhost→::1 ambiguity on Linux).\n\nFixes launcher.py: managed-mode path no longer unconditionally injects\nmanaged-port URLs (8001/5178). Pi backend runs on 8000; shell reads\nFLASHPOINT_BACKEND_HEALTH_URL from env (set by pi_start.sh) instead.\nUnmanaged (Mac dev) path is unchanged.\n\nKnown gap documented: frontend delivery on Pi is unresolved. Shell\nwill connect to backend but fail to load React UI until static serving\nis added. Interim: use scripts/run.sh for Pi dev/testing.\n\nCLAUDE.md updated: Pi backend service scaffolding and autostart\nscaffolding marked done; Pi end-to-end READY path and hardware\nvalidation remain not started.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f5950791045aad9c273c05d8fe565f6b696f15e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/8f5950791045aad9c273c05d8fe565f6b696f15e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDRhOTBmZTEwNDkyYTExZGZhZjQwNzM1N2M2N2MzYjM3NTZlMWE5MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/b5de30458086916266b0e756054d053a4c3e271d","sha":"b5de30458086916266b0e756054d053a4c3e271d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/b5de30458086916266b0e756054d053a4c3e271d"}],"sha":"4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/4a90fe10492a11dfaf407357c67c3b3756e1a906"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/b5de30458086916266b0e756054d053a4c3e271d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T05:54:38Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T05:54:38Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: add desktop runtime configuration\n\nCentralize all desktop shell and launcher constants into\ndesktop/app/config.py — single source of truth for both\nlauncher.py and window.py.\n\n- New desktop/app/config.py with three tiers:\n    STANDALONE: URL fallback defaults (localhost:8000/5173)\n    MANAGED: orchestrated-path ports/URLs/timeouts (8001/5178)\n    PI_SEAMS: env-var flags for Pi deployment without code edits\n\n- Pi seam flags (all off by default, preserving current behavior):\n    FLASHPOINT_FULLSCREEN  — showFullScreen() vs window.show()\n    FLASHPOINT_DEV_QUIT    — gate custom QShortcut registration\n    FLASHPOINT_MANAGED     — skip subprocess management\n    FLASHPOINT_PORTRAIT    — future use, not yet wired\n\n- launcher.py: remove inline constants, import from config\n- window.py: remove inline constants, import from config;\n  BACKEND_HEALTH_URL/FRONTEND_URL still read env vars at deferred\n  import time (post launcher injection), use config.STANDALONE_*\n  as fallback strings\n- main.py: showFullScreen() vs show() driven by config.FULLSCREEN\n- .env.example: document desktop shell env var seams\n- desktop/README.md, CLAUDE.md: update config docs\n\nNo change to default runtime behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c451a6eddfc1cb27935787e5a2af33f59d5fe19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/7c451a6eddfc1cb27935787e5a2af33f59d5fe19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/b5de30458086916266b0e756054d053a4c3e271d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: