om/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/73c8d73e1a6a63489ff5e5238f1af1bebdb3aafc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-25T03:31:27Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-25T03:31:27Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: bootstrap PySide6 desktop shell\n\nAdd desktop/ scaffold implementing the PySide6 fullscreen shell for\nMilestone A. The shell embeds the React/Vite frontend in QWebEngineView\nand provides native loading and backend-unavailable states.\n\nNew files:\n  desktop/__init__.py           package root (safe module isolation)\n  desktop/app/__init__.py       package marker\n  desktop/app/main.py           QApplication entry point\n  desktop/app/window.py         MainWindow + _HealthPoller + _OverlayWidget\n  desktop/requirements.txt      PySide6>=6.6.0\n  desktop/README.md             dev setup, architecture, Pi future notes\n  scripts/dev_desktop.sh        convenience launcher\n\nShell behavior:\n- shows native \"Connecting…\" overlay immediately on launch\n- polls GET /api/v1/health in a background thread (2s interval, 10 retries)\n- loads localhost:5173 (Vite dev) in QWebEngineView once backend responds\n- shows \"Backend not responding\" + Retry button after ~20s of failures\n- FramelessWindowHint + showFullScreen(), no browser chrome\n- Ctrl+Q to quit (dev only; remove for Pi production)\n\nBackend and frontend are unchanged. Launch with:\n  .venv/bin/python -m desktop.app.main","tree":{"sha":"5cfaf287b1a13462e21e5ca890b15482160154c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/5cfaf287b1a13462e21e5ca890b15482160154c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/73c8d73e1a6a63489ff5e5238f1af1bebdb3aafc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/73c8d73e1a6a63489ff5e5238f1af1bebdb3aafc","node_id":"C_kwDORuGHBNoAKDczYzhkNzNlMWE2YTYzNDg5ZmY1ZTUyMzhmMWFmMWJlYmRiM2FhZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commit/ff79911041e096e68a3d308b6f334de70ea8d701","sha":"ff79911041e096e68a3d308b6f334de70ea8d701","url":"https://api