dataset. Default limit 100→500, max 500→1000.\n\nFrontend: initial load fetches 500 events (was 100). App tracks\nloadedCount / total / hasMore / offset state. handleLoadMore() fetches\nthe next 500-event page and merges by event.id before appending state,\nguarding against duplicates if ingest data changes between page fetches.\nEventFeed shows \"N / total\" count when more remains, adds secondary\n\"· N visible\" label when active filters reduce the visible set, and\nrenders a \"Load more · N remaining\" button at the feed bottom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b2b67763030068ed3f3e3a13299c4a12679dde1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/4b2b67763030068ed3f3e3a13299c4a12679dde1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/39d903c08daea23ce982efe8a5c31fd5e53f6b0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/char