e":"2026-03-25T02:21:19Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: load real hotspot member events in detail pane\n\nWire the existing GET /api/v1/hotspots/{id} endpoint to the detail pane\nso hotspot selection shows actual cluster member events from the backend\nrather than a client-side proximity filter over the truncated event slice.\n\n- api.js: add fetchHotspotDetail(id)\n- App.jsx: on hotspot selection, fetch detail and store in hotspotDetail\n  state; pass to DetailPane; clear on deselect/escape/filter-out.\n  pendingHotspotId ref guards against stale responses when selection\n  changes before a prior fetch settles.\n- DetailPane: remove proximityEvents(); HotspotDetail accepts memberEvents\n  + loading props from backend response; shows \"Loading events…\" while\n  in-flight; section label \"Nearby Events\" → \"Member Events\".\n\nNo backend changes. EventDetail path unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"558667e3004dba7436450cc3456730573f8d83ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/558667e3004dba7436450cc3456730573f8d83ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/b1d650146303bc0628f52531d77393c51dba655f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/charlie-axelbaum","id":64117841,"login":"charlie-axelbaum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTE3ODQx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum