arlie-axelbaum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/3b67b20098f2c2e63f378213ccad83452ac6ac9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:40:17Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:40:17Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: add GDELT 2.0 real-data ingestion pipeline\n\nIntroduces GDELT as the first live source. Switch via INGEST_SOURCE=gdelt\nin .env; mock mode is fully preserved and unchanged.\n\n- GdeltSource: fetches 15-min export files (24h first-run seed,\n  checkpoint-based thereafter), filters to US unrest events (CAMEO\n  root codes 14/17/18), normalizes to EventCreate\n- Source-aware checkpointing: GDELT IngestRun history isolated from mock\n- Startup migration: adds ingest_source column non-destructively\n- System status and freshness filtered by configured ingest source\n- Fix config.py env_file path to resolve from repo root, not CWD\n\nMilestone scope: real events on map and feed; priorities panel\npartially real (5 pre-seeded centroids only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"275ead9d103e8caa14d850ddac9aafd2a0511202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/275ead9d103e8caa14d850ddac9aafd2a0511202"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/3b67b20098f2c2e63f378213ccad83452ac6ac9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cha