arlie-axelbaum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/commits/8bfb019547c0fd6d0aa5537cb5ea9dcccd7b6ec1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T03:46:56Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T03:46:56Z","email":"axelbaumcharles@gmail.com","name":"Charlie Axelbaum"},"message":"feat: persist ingest run status and scheduler freshness\n\n- Add IngestRun model (ingest_runs table) tracking started_at,\n  finished_at, status, events_inserted, error_message per run\n- run_mock_ingestion writes a run record before ingestion; updates to\n  success (with finished_at) or failed (with error_message) on completion\n- Failure path rolls back event inserts only; run record is preserved\n- SystemStatusResponse adds last_run_at, last_success_at (finished_at of\n  most recent success), last_run_status, last_error (only when most recent\n  run failed, else null)\n- is_stale now based on last_success_at (run freshness) not last_computed_at\n- last_computed_at retained separately as compute freshness\n- Default ingestion interval changed from 300s to 1800s (30 min)","tree":{"sha":"a765cd34a7816f6cec20608ceb96d2908d89b921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/trees/a765cd34a7816f6cec20608ceb96d2908d89b921"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/charlie-axelbaum/Flashpoint/git/commits/8bfb019547c0fd6d0aa5537cb5ea9dcccd7b6ec1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64117841?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/charlie-axelbaum/gists{/gist_id}"