gDOChrBUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prasanth631/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prasanth631/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prasanth631/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prasanth631/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prasanth631/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prasanth631","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prasanth631/Capstone/commits/7e716baf447caf69e779bd3919563834d4ac76ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T13:52:46Z","email":"prasanthgolla29@gmail.com","name":"Prasanth"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T13:52:46Z","email":"prasanthgolla29@gmail.com","name":"Prasanth"},"message":"feat: add Trivy security scanning + Prometheus/Grafana monitoring\n\nJenkins Pipeline:\n- Add Security Scan (Trivy) stage after Docker Build & Push\n- Auto-installs Trivy on Windows if not found\n- Scans backend and frontend images for vulnerabilities\n- Publishes JSON reports to backend API and archives as build artifacts\n\nBackend:\n- Add SecurityScanService.java (store/retrieve scans in Firestore)\n- Add SecurityScanController.java (POST /api/security/scan-result, GET /api/security/latest)\n- Allow /api/security/** in SecurityConfig without authentication\n\nKubernetes:\n- Deploy Grafana to default namespace on NodePort 30030\n- Pre-configured with Prometheus datasource + JVM metrics dashboard\n- Update Prometheus config to scrape dev/staging/production namespaces\n\nFrontend:\n- Add SecurityScanPanel component with severity badges and per-image scan cards\n- Add PrometheusMetricsPanel with Grafana iframes, time range selector, and offline fallback\n- Integrate both panels into DashboardPage layout\n- Add all panel CSS to index.css","tree":{"sha":"b540a826cb246f64e902e8c5ec785c9a2592a8c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Prasanth63