":"Pedro Tainha"},"message":"repro: dev mode broken with Vite 7 — shared deps resolve to Promises\n\nMinimal host + remote setup demonstrating that @module-federation/vite\ndev mode fails with Vite 7 (Rollup-based). Build/preview mode works.\n\nIn dev mode, loadShare wrappers use CJS with a TLA placeholder that\nthe PluginDevProxyModuleTopLevelAwait plugin cannot transform, causing\nshared deps to resolve as Promises instead of actual modules.","tree":{"sha":"4e74410295a88cf4961bd13beeaa95c75af81a33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrotainha/mf-vite7-dev-repro/git/trees/4e74410295a88cf4961bd13beeaa95c75af81a33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrotainha/mf-vite7-dev-repro/git/commits/0caa3b0c082c403bb2acf317af7b8eb9feb90d6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4137458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrotainha","id":4137458,"login":"pedrotainha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzc0NTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrotainha","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrotainha/mf-vite7-dev-repro/commit/0caa3b0c082c403bb2acf317af7b8eb9feb90d6d","node_id":"C_kwDORub_G9oAKDBjYWEzYjBjMDgyYzQwM2JiMmFjZjM