gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912","id":89154289,"login":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/a441cc1497499ae13398975cb6d7b25f3314df0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T13:34:27Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T13:34:27Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"message":"fix(restaurant): correct reviews column name to fix 400 on top-rated\n\nrestaurant-service V16 created the shared reviews table with a \"content\"\ncolumn, but the Review entity (and the canonical monolith schema) map the\nreview text to \"comment\". When restaurant-service migrated first, the table\nwas created as \"content\" and getTopRatedRestaurants() failed with\n''column comment does not exist'', returning 400 on /restaurant/top-rated.\n\n- V16: rename content -> comment, add created_at to match the canonical schema\n- V17: idempotent repair for already-migrated databases (rename column /\n  add created_at only when needed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d243aed2136e78622ae7e3202a74b45d62e8b10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/trees/7d243aed2136e78622ae7e3202a74b45d62e8b10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/commits/a441cc1497499ae13398975cb6d7b25f3314df0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912","id":89154289,"login":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commit/a441cc1497499ae13398975cb6d7b25f3314df0f","node_id":"C_kwDORupLdNoAKGE0NDFjYzE0OTc0OTlhZTEzMzk4OTc1Y2I2ZDdiMjVmMzMxNGRmMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commit/109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361","sha":"109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361"}],"sha":"a441cc1497499ae13398975cb6d7b25f3314df0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/a441cc1497499ae13398975cb6d7b25f3314df0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912","id":89154289,"login":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T13:34:17Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T13:34:17Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"message":"fix(auth): align monolith JWT signing with auth-service to stop 401 on review/feedback\n\nThe tastetest-awdb monolith (serves /api/v1/review and /api/v1/feedback)\nused the legacy jjwt String API, which Base64-decodes the secret. Every\nother service derives the HS512 key from the raw UTF-8 bytes of the same\nshared secret, so tokens issued by auth-service failed signature\nverification here and every protected endpoint returned 401 Unauthorized.\n\nSwitch to SecretKeySpec(secret.getBytes(UTF_8), \"HmacSHA512\") + parserBuilder,\nmatching auth-service/gateway/restaurant/user/notification/agent.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"400cce565c4b4e3d03d199392160fc572ded20d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/trees/400cce565c4b4e3d03d199392160fc572ded20d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/commits/109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912","id":89154289,"login":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commit/109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361","node_id":"C_kwDORupLdNoAKDEwOTIwM2Y0MjIwOTJiZDY4MGZkNDMxMDRiYTk4NGI4YjliNGYzNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commit/ae958c01371677c2dc3c8804c9ddb38230b771f3","sha":"ae958c01371677c2dc3c8804c9ddb38230b771f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/ae958c01371677c2dc3c8804c9ddb38230b771f3"}],"sha":"109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/109203f422092bd680fd43104ba984b8b9b4f361"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.