:{"date":"2026-06-14T15:30:00Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"message":"9. NoSQL & Caching feat: add Redis caching for restaurant-service and MongoDB notification history\n\n- Cache getAllRestaurants(), getTopRatedRestaurants() and getRatings(id) with\n  differentiated TTLs (CacheConfig), evicting on local mutations.\n- Persist each notification as a document in MongoDB and expose\n  GET /api/notifications/history (last 20).\n- Add redis and mongo containers to docker-compose with healthchecks and a\n  persistent volume for Mongo.","tree":{"sha":"2a43cbb875669c65f5ea218ef9f6ae9e56a9f3de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/trees/2a43cbb875669c65f5ea218ef9f6ae9e56a9f3de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/commits/51120ac57cfcf0d9a3f4d2c470fbd678f8cb99ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912","id":89154289,"login":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commit/51120ac57cfcf0d9