lcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/3036655f32aaefee9112bc18ae94c2d9a107b9fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:40:16Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T16:40:16Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"message":"Add frontend guide; update deps & APIs\n\nAdd a comprehensive FRONTEND_GUIDE.md documenting the Angular frontend structure, routes and run instructions. Make frontend adjustments: tweak restaurants component (CSS, template, TS), add a Page model and update restaurant service to support the updated listing/pagination behavior. Sync backend API changes by updating controllers, repositories and services for Restaurant, Menu, MenuItem and Review, and add a DB migration (V13__ADD_MORE_RESTAURANTS.sql) to populate additional restaurants. Also include an updated frontend package lock / dependency metadata.","tree":{"sha":"4e65adeb7034320317e9e5a8ff7e0f99b8e8015a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/trees/4e65adeb7034320317e9e5a8ff7e0f99b8e8015a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/commits/3036655f32aaefee9112bc18ae94c2d9a107b9fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/priv