ceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/4f9c3bfd723a4d07d6924d6eb2946277dbb75b4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T17:16:15Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T17:16:15Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"message":"Add dev/test Spring profiles & H2 support\n\nIntroduce multi-environment configuration and H2 test support: add application.yml (common), application-dev.yml (Postgres + Flyway) and application-test.yml (H2 in-memory, port 8091, flyway disabled, security disabled for tests). Move legacy application.properties content into YAML structure and keep a short placeholder file. Add H2 runtime dependency to pom.xml. Enable SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=dev in docker-compose and add profile-aware behavior: annotate ApplicationInitializer with @Profile(\"!test\") to avoid running on test profile, adjust SecurityConfiguration to allow H2 console frames when security is disabled, and set tests to run with @ActiveProfiles(\"test\"). Update README with local run instructions and add USE_PROFILES.md with quick commands. Misc: small test and README edits.","tree":{"sha":"40fe99a10f7be9cbe215350aa0a2dd1dbdf59e7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/trees/40fe99a10f7be9cbe215350aa0a2dd1dbdf59e7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/commits/4f9c3bfd723a4d07d6924d6eb2946277dbb75b4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at"