ogin":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/7fb54db29155eaf0c5337cec76555285a358d733/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T15:03:48Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T15:03:48Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"message":"Add Menu and MenuItem entities, services, APIs\n\nIntroduce Menu and MenuItem domain model. Adds JPA entities (Menu, MenuItem), repositories (MenuRepository, MenuItemRepository) and DTOs (MenuDto, MenuItemDto). Implements service layers (MenuService, MenuItemService) with owner checks, menu/menu-item validation, and retrieval methods. Exposes REST endpoints via controllers (MenuController at /api/v1/menus and MenuItemController at /api/v1/menu-items) for add, delete, update and get operations (including get-by-menu and getRestaurantMenus). Includes basic logging and security annotations to restrict actions to appropriate roles.","tree":{"sha":"5b6ea6251004e79b268eab94f4edfa7b1830eeb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/trees/5b6ea6251004e79b268eab94f4edfa7b1830eeb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/commits/7fb54db29155eaf0c5337cec76555285a358d733","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4",