8","sha":"c9b33b012fe35028b66cf987d23436f4aeb766c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/c9b33b012fe35028b66cf987d23436f4aeb766c8"}],"sha":"bba0abe077310cc1534c648808fb1fe26252fa44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/bba0abe077310cc1534c648808fb1fe26252fa44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912","id":89154289,"login":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commits/c9b33b012fe35028b66cf987d23436f4aeb766c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T16:48:57Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T16:48:57Z","email":"mihai.popescu1109@gmail.com","name":"Popescu Mihai"},"message":"Add authentication controller, services and DTOs\n\nIntroduce basic authentication flow: AuthController (/api/v1/auth) with endpoints for /register, /login and /token (validate). Add AuthService implementing register and login logic using UserRepository, RoleRepository, PasswordEncoder, AuthenticationManager and JwtGenerator; throws BadRequestException for invalid requests. Add EmailService to send simple mail messages (send call commented out in controller). Add DTOs: RegisterDto, LoginDto and LoginResponseDto (uses token.ttl property). Add BadRequestException runtime exception. Note: this change expects Role \"USER\" to exist, JwtGenerator, repositories and JavaMailSender to be configured; LoginResponseDto is a Spring component and is mutated when returning a token.","tree":{"sha":"95a722530139d8cc78ef198366f55513827843c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/trees/95a722530139d8cc78ef198366f55513827843c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/git/commits/c9b33b012fe35028b66cf987d23436f4aeb766c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89154289?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912","id":89154289,"login":"Mihai1912","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTU0Mjg5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mihai1912","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Mihai1912/TasteTest-AWBD/commit/c9b33b012fe35028b66cf987d23436f4aeb766c8","node_id":"C_kwDORupLdNoAKGM5YjMzYjAxMmZlMzUwMjhiNjZjZjk4N2QyMzQzNmY0YWViNzY2Yzg","parents":[{"html_url":"ht