 a scoped background-image takes a Media Library attachment id written\n  as a number (P-19''s ratified shape); a token reference passed the write\n  gate and painted nothing with no report. Refused at write, ledgered at emit.\n- F2: pp_layer3_content_problem() refuses control bytes before its closed\n  grammar; trim() hid them and the emitter printed them into the style.\n- F3: block-ellipsis and line-clamp join the text-bearing properties\n  (CSS Overflow 4 renders a string; text-overflow reasoning).\n- A condition refusal names its condition once.\n\nEach reproduction is pinned red. Coverage-audit rows added: a keyed-map\nsheet in findings, non-string conditions, the taught prompt example.","tree":{"sha":"306087930b07ec46e68cf7257206e427afb948fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/trees/306087930b07ec46e68cf7257206e427afb948fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/commits/43b2769663dfce7ee9338b0f5f1f313f2f691d75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79067086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76","id":79067086,"login":"FJCF76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDY3MDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76","user_view_type"