"date":"2026-10-05T13:27:46Z","email":"fernando@covecino.net","name":"Fernando Covecino"},"message":"fix: the MathML value gate matches the SVG one, and link and media-type values are text (#1242 T3a)\n\nOrchestrator ruling of 2026-10-05: a link''s download, target, rel, hreflang and\nreferrerpolicy and MathML encoding are text, not CSS; MathML ids, classes,\ndata-* and style are not judged as CSS values, as on SVG. The MathML gate\nrefuses comment delimiters, control characters and the CSS structure\ncharacters before it reads functions, so a comment cannot pair the quotes the\nfunction check skips. Its separate no-URL test is gone: the function list\nalready refuses url() and its family.","tree":{"sha":"2b4f726ad899efe887aba026286f1532a383d73f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/trees/2b4f726ad899efe887aba026286f1532a383d73f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/commits/c2e2c22fbc08dd68819388f8db6d5a6a61e54951","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79067086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76","id":79067086,"login":"FJCF76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDY3MDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commit/c2e2c22fbc08dd68819388f8db6d5a6a61e54951","node_id":"C_kwDORu3kjNoAKGMyZTJjMjJmYmMwOGRkNjg4MTkzODhmOGRiNmQ1YTZhNjFlNTQ5NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commit/63ebaa09af93b77932b4529c3ffb3a2d1b024c15","sha":"63ebaa09af93b77932b4529c3ffb3a2d1b024c15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commits/63ebaa09af93b77932b4529c3ffb3a2d1b024c15"}],"sha":"c2e2c22fbc08dd68819388f8db6d5a6a61e54951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commits/c2e2c22fbc08dd68819388f8db6d5a6a61e54951"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79067086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76","id":79067086,"login":"FJCF76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDY3MDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commits/63ebaa09af93b77932b4529c3ffb3a2d1b024c15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:18:04Z","email":"fernando@covecino.net","name":"Fernando Covecino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:18:04Z","email":"fernando@covecino.net","name":"Fernando Covecino"},"message":"fix: the CSS function list judges every SVG and MathML value except text attributes (#1242 T3a)\n\nOrchestrator ruling of 2026-10-05: deny-by-default sits on the checked set.\nEvery admitted SVG and MathML attribute value is judged except a named list of\ntext attributes (aria-*, title, alttext, lang, role, editor namespaces), so\ngeometry, font and colour attributes no longer let attr() or an unknown\nfunction through. path() and the font-variant-alternates functions are\nadmitted; attr() and the anchor-positioning family stay refused. Tests pin the\ncall between two quoted strings and the scheme arm of the PDF origin check on\nan http site.","tree":{"sha":"031018749dfafe5ec7ac1213e7c496e39c9cf105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/trees/031018749dfafe5ec7ac1213e7c496e39c9cf105"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/commits/63ebaa09af93b77932b4529c3ffb3a2d1b024c15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79067086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76","id":79067086,"login":"FJCF76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDY3MDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commit/63ebaa09af93b77932b4529c3ffb3a2d1b024c15","node_id":"C_kwDORu3kjNoAKD