orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commits/27a3fbe6e937c50244805bddafa865a198c8e5f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:26Z","email":"fernando@covecino.net","name":"Fernando Covecino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:26Z","email":"fernando@covecino.net","name":"Fernando Covecino"},"message":"feat: descope forms from the content gate; origin-exact PDF, default-deny CSS functions, bucketed matcher (#1242 T3a)\n\nOwner ruling of 2026-10-05: form and its controls are refused (clause D5,\nnamed as descoped) until the Layer-3 forms contract admits them; the\ncredential gate, the admin-endpoint analysis and the parser form-owner\nreading leave with the arm. button, label, meter and progress stay.\n\nThe same-install PDF check compares the canonical origin, port included. CSS\nfunctions in style and SVG values are default-deny: an unlisted function such\nas -moz-element() is refused. The M-2 matcher looks bands up in buckets, so it\nstays linear in the number of bands. A fragment-reference refusal shows the\nattribute''s own value, and a stored usemap is read after its first ''#''.","tree":{"sha":"78c28df9dbcda34c62d25632f83c2218a5eea5e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/trees/78c28df9dbcda34c62d25632f83c2218a5eea5e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/commits/27a3fbe6e937c50244805bddafa865a198c8e5f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconte