rs/FJCF76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/commits/920a16d1f1c9d7509e47178f899277b74dd5df27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:43:08Z","email":"fernando@covecino.net","name":"Fernando Covecino"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:43:08Z","email":"fernando@covecino.net","name":"Fernando Covecino"},"message":"fix: one URL canonicaliser and bounded cross-band facts for the content gate (#1242 T3a)\n\nEvery URL-judging arm (E2, srcset, the P-11 PDF object, the trust tier and the\nforms gate) now reads a URL through one parser with browser semantics: control\ncharacters stripped, backslash as slash, dot segments resolved, the page''s own\nscheme without an authority read as a relative path. A URL it cannot parse is\nrefused. The admin-endpoint match runs on the canonical path, PATH_INFO included.\n\nThe unchanged-band facts walk is bounded by the write''s value count as well as\nits bytes, and skips values that cannot carry a fact. usemap and same-document\nSVG fragment references join E12, symmetric with ids. The trust tier reads URLs\nthrough the same parser, follows core''s data-* grammar and requires a style to\nsurvive core''s CSS filter whole.","tree":{"sha":"cb129a629abe0e87a62dd395cf7e6f4874f5ab12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/trees/cb129a629abe0e87a62dd395cf7e6f4874f5ab12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/commits/920a16d1f1c9d7509e47178f899277b74dd5df27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at"