 the pages you can work on\n\nThe chat''s page selector, the page list handed to the chat script and\nthe page inventory in the system prompt now list only the pages the\ncurrent user can edit (pp_ai_editable_pages(), the same per-page check\neach chat turn makes). With none, the selector reads WordPress''s own\n\"No pages found.\" and sending says so as a plain status; the prompt\nsays \"None you can edit.\" unless the user sees every page in the Pages\nscreen and the site has none. The page-version read answers a page that\ndoes not exist the same way as one the user may not edit.\n\nTests: ChatPageListPermissionTest, pp-ai-chat-page-list-empty.test.js;\nthe test bootstrap gains __() and esc_html__() stubs.","tree":{"sha":"a3fbf7ace3ec1a77b2c82ba70eaa96beeba469fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/trees/a3fbf7ace3ec1a77b2c82ba70eaa96beeba469fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FJCF76/PromptingPress/git/commits/f4da28e9631bdd7ff29bd65834d06afc235d64c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79067086?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FJCF76","id":79067086,"login":"FJCF76","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MDY3MDg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FJCF76"