:{"account":{"login":"pranav8494","providerType":"User"},"email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-23T22:42:09Z","committedDate":"2026-03-23T22:42:09Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"pranav8494","providerType":"User"},"email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:19:44.859Z","repositoryId":1190022468,"sha":"c98dd9972249951ed06d29a555393735ab416c4e"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"pranav8494","providerType":"User"},"email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-23T22:41:33Z","committedDate":"2026-03-23T22:41:33Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"pranav8494","providerType":"User"},"email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:19:44.859Z","repositoryId":1190022468,"sha":"d0a3793d6f9f244251648d4ad9e4552afe7179c6"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"pranav8494","providerType":"User"},"email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav PANDEY"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-23T22:30:16Z","committedDate":"2026-03-23T22:30:16Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:19:44.859Z","repositoryId":1190022468,"sha":"efdd80b3ad885f86b0fbe955c3ccc3816ab91cd3"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:19:44.859Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/4f10d046831259949e233850f2e57280176b9b32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:59:20Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav PANDEY"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:59:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Replace frontend skills with composable planner/engineer/reviewer trio (#6)\n\nThe three frontend skills were flat and overlapping: each restated React,\naccessibility and TypeScript rules, so a fix had to be applied three times,\nand fintech-frontend-engineer was frontend-designer plus money rules copied\ninline. Nothing planned frontend work or captured project conventions.\n\nAdds three domain-agnostic base skills (plan, build, review) and an overlay\nmechanism on two axes. Domain knowledge (fintech, travel) and stack knowledge\n(framework and versions) live in overlays/ as delta files with three headings,\none per base skill. Adding a domain is now one small file instead of a forked\nskill, and a fix to the base is inherited everywhere.\n\nEach base skill''s Iron Law requires loading applicable overlays and announcing\nwhich were loaded, since a silently skipped overlay is the failure mode this\nmechanism has to guard against.\n\nBREAKING: /frontend-designer becomes /frontend-engineer,\n/frontend-code-reviewer becomes /frontend-reviewer.\n/fintech-frontend-engineer keeps its name as a shim over the base plus overlay.","tree":{"sha":"7e30dc4689a3a9791799feb089d9266e373f6207","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/7e30dc4689a3a9791799feb089d9266e373f6207"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/4f10d046831259949e233850f2e57280176b9b32","verification":{"payload":"tree 7e30dc4689a3a9791799feb089d9266e373f6207\nparent 232f5d4eeb89ce3deb3258c08fa08a0b1663bc84\nauthor Pranav PANDEY <pranav8494@gmail.com> 1791323960 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791323960 +0200\n\nReplace frontend skills with composable planner/engineer/reviewer trio (#6)\n\nThe three frontend skills were flat and overlapping: each restated React,\naccessibility and TypeScript rules, so a fix had to be applied three times,\nand fintech-frontend-engineer was frontend-designer plus money rules copied\ninline. Nothing planned frontend work or captured project conventions.\n\nAdds three domain-agnostic base skills (plan, build, review) and an overlay\nmechanism on two axes. Domain knowledge (fintech, travel) and stack knowledge\n(framework and versions) live in overlays/ as delta files with three headings,\none per base skill. Adding a domain is now one small file instead of a forked\nskill, and a fix to the base is inherited everywhere.\n\nEach base skill''s Iron Law requires loading applicable overlays and announcing\nwhich were loaded, since a silently skipped overlay is the failure mode this\nmechanism has to guard against.\n\nBREAKING: /frontend-designer becomes /frontend-engineer,\n/frontend-code-reviewer becomes /frontend-reviewer.\n/fintech-frontend-engineer keeps its name as a shim over the base plus overlay.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxW84CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS8oQAJ2jXaFC5BG1uhyWEKIJvL+q\nIP2v4gt3ZWgSB6C7QWgP6GpZVUwiakbPvimLn6+DSZky5Yo/PWNaMGOx918v93GU\nRx1KT4zMexYg39AZIFTytuUkABEyDAubbeGGLh1JG7Sqsr6NM5vB176bkVSmM3PF\nbIZshjDFXeSYYY+uVMZHB9KFZqX7CzQb7zHxuzLkB4fclp2yqMn5jHkqneF5nUfY\ntM40YCkBX1ZqSsvsbz83mmoihbd7JsmbTtaE2US/P/R9Buz4UDse2sUG64xL94/5\nLmMukY47AcH30wOF8gG5lv28RwVfnb9/XlgOa3NY76gHGu/T2oXlIfseoyoqvQL1\nUiKoodP3ouUKx0XPktcfAGhq2sjK9U4UhgVeRvoqWZt0PD7nlhsu+KosrbeNPutk\nSn/03Regvzhb0TmPoS8sxMtA6S