se,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/6dd92b4cb67177137b56734ddf7c5cc872203e95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T21:33:54Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T21:33:54Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"message":"Wave 3 architecture improvements: critic pass, trace log, failure recovery, shared scratchpad\n\nOrchestrator (orchestrator/SKILL.md):\n- Phase 4: added Shared Findings Scratchpad — captures key facts from parallel\n  agents and passes them to sequential agents via the CONTEXT field; lightweight\n  shared-memory mechanism between parallel runs (closes G1)\n- Phase 5: synthesis format now includes Agent Trace Log — structured table of\n  agent / task / confidence / action-taken for every dispatch in the run\n- New Phase 5.5: Optional Critic Pass — conditions table for when to invoke\n  senior-engineer as a critic, plus the exact Context Envelope and output\n  format (ERROR/CONFLICT/ASSUMPTION/GAP labels + OVERALL verdict)\n- Fallback: added two timeout/partial-failure rows — single agent retry\n  protocol, and multi-agent partial-failure completion rule (closes G8)\n\nsenior-engineer (skills/senior-engineer/SKILL.md):\n- Task Approach: added Critic pass row documenting the agent''s role when\n  invoked by the orchestrator with combined specialist output","tree":{"sha":"1033d1627184981bde2d680ca1b57592c408a495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/1033d1627184981bde2d680ca1b57592c408a495"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/6dd92b4cb67177137b56734ddf7c5cc872203e95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un