rs/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/633602ea123113f8e666882ec2eaa166ddcbf490/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T21:31:13Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T21:31:13Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"message":"Wave 2 architecture improvements: context envelope, confidence signalling, trust tiers, blocked-state protocol\n\nOrchestrator (orchestrator/SKILL.md):\n- Phase 3 Announce: task list now includes trust tier labels (T1/T2/T3)\n- Phase 4 Dispatch: added Context Envelope — standard five-field structure\n  for every agent dispatch (TASK / CONTEXT / CONSTRAINTS / OUTPUT FORMAT /\n  CONFIDENCE SIGNAL), eliminating ambiguous prompts as a cause of low-confidence\n  responses (closes G1, makes G3 tractable)\n- Phase 5 Synthesise: added Confidence Routing table — orchestrator acts on\n  High/Medium/Low/BLOCKED signals before including output in synthesis\n- New section: Trust Tier Model — T1 research (no confirmation), T2 artifact\n  (confirm before writing), T3 execution (explicit per-action sign-off)\n- Fallback: added BLOCKED signal handling row with three-branch resolution\n\nAll 17 specialist skills:\n- Added ## Output Protocol at end of each skill — defines the CONFIDENCE and\n  BLOCKED signal contract specia