 reports, runbooks, postmortems, toil audits, IaC, chaos experiment designs).\n\nRemoved: on-call staffing targets, shift health metrics, incident role\ncoordination (IC/Comms Lead/Scribe) — these describe team operations, not\nClaude tasks. Retained all reference frameworks (SLO math, Four Golden Signals,\nburn rate model, PRR checklist, postmortem template, toil table, IaC principles,\nchaos engineering) as tools Claude reaches for during specific tasks.","tree":{"sha":"bf404ff0f5af19a3cec0ce9954992d8f9a140620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/bf404ff0f5af19a3cec0ce9954992d8f9a140620"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/522476a95345b16859bd82026d0d01a4e3b7fe1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/522476a95345b16859bd82026d0d01a4e3b7fe1a","node_id":"C_kwDORu5NRNoAKDUyMjQ3NmE5NTM0NWIxNjg1OWJkODIwMjZkMGQwMWE0Z