i.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/40cce4040287592e1fe7ce81256a17ed5897c2af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T09:38:19Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T09:38:19Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"message":"update all skills to v2.1.0 with Iron Laws, anti-pattern tables, and concrete checklists\n\nRewrote all 18 skill files to drop persona prose (Who You Are, How You Think,\nHow You Communicate) and replace with structured, actionable content:\n\n- Iron Law per skill (concrete, role-specific non-negotiable)\n- Paradigm identification tables for engineering roles (OOP/FP/Hybrid)\n- SOLID apply/don''t-apply tables (senior-engineer, backend-engineer)\n- GoF pattern tables with use-cases and watch-outs\n- Anti-pattern tables with required replacements (React, Kotlin, TypeScript, SQL)\n- Test pyramid with ratios and deviation rules (qa-engineer, senior-engineer)\n- DORA metrics with elite benchmarks and improvement actions (devex, project-manager)\n- SPACE framework for developer productivity (devex)\n- Four Product Risks table with validation methods (product-manager)\n- JTBD and Opportunity Solution Tree frameworks (product-manager, ux-researcher)\n- RICE formula with pitfalls (product-manager)\n- RAID log, RAG status, sprint ceremony checklists (project-manager)\n- SLO/SLI/error budget formulas and policy table (sre)\n- Four Golden Signals with alert conditions (sre)\n- Blameless postmortem template (sre)\n- PRR six-dimension checklist (sre)\n- Diátaxis quadrant table with when-to-use (document-writer)\n- ADR, runbook, API reference templates (document-writer)\n- Method selection table keyed to research question (ux-researcher)\n- Three-pillar diagnostic and ranking drop checklist (seo-manager)\n- E-E-A-T guidance for YMYL/fintech content (seo-manager)\n- Financial display rules with Intl.NumberFormat examples (fintech-frontend-engineer)\n- Core Web Vitals thresholds with fix patterns across multiple skills\n- Data quality checks and SQL anti-pattern table (data-analyst)\n- Statistical testing guide with pitfalls (data-analyst)","tree":{"sha":"489b11804b44b9b12452884f5fc45559b2197ec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/489b11804b44b9b12452884f5fc45559b2197ec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/40cce4040287592e1fe7ce81256a17ed5897c2af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git