ansparency on routing decisions\n- Inherits permission + notification behaviour from routed role","tree":{"sha":"4522154ac50b3514eb6bfe25e6eff094c119f723","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/4522154ac50b3514eb6bfe25e6eff094c119f723"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/ab9d0b4d014918da5102b5c4bfdf105e809521e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/ab9d0b4d014918da5102b5c4bfdf105e809521e7","node_id":"C_kwDORu5NRNoAKGFiOWQwYjRkMDE0OTE4ZGE1MTAyYjVjNGJmZGYxMDVlODA5NTIxZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/db7732d7c2f3715aa7f0fc636f3d408e41648e7c","sha":"db7732d7c2f3715aa7f0fc636f3d408e41648e7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/db7732d7c2f3715aa7f0fc636f3d408e41648e7c"}],"sha":"ab9d0b4d014918da5102b5c4bfdf105e809521e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/ab9d0b4d014918da5102b5c4bfdf105e809521e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/db7732d7c2f3715aa7f0fc636f3d408e41648e7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:47:21Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:47:21Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"message":"S8-S10: add devex, product-manager, and qa-engineer skills\n\nDevEx researched from: DORA four key metrics (Google Cloud), SPACE\nframework, Pragmatic Engineer on developer experience.\n- DORA: Deployment Frequency, Lead Time, MTTR, Change Failure Rate\n- Developer time as measurable cost; shift-left principle\n- Internal tools treated as products with the same quality bar\n\nProduct Manager researched from: SVPG (Marty Cagan) on product vs\nfeature teams, Productboard PM responsibilities guide.\n- Empowered product teams vs feature teams distinction (Cagan)\n- Four risks: value, usability, feasibility, viability\n- Outcomes over outputs; missionaries vs mercenaries\n- Fall in love with the problem, not the solution\n\nQA Engineer researched from: Martin Fowler on quality and delivery\nspeed, testing pyramid principles, risk-based testing.\n- Quality built in, not bolted on\n- Test pyramid as a budget: unit (cheap) to E2E (expensive)\n- Flaky tests as technical debt\n- QA as continuous team activity, not a handoff gate\n\nAll three include permission + notification pattern in workflow","tree":{"sha":"6daa475788454700e365172437b197f50082a549","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/6daa475788454700e365172437b197f50082a549"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/db7732d7c2f3715aa7f0fc636f3d408e41648e7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/db7732d7c2f3715aa7f0fc636f3d408e41648e7c","node_id":"C_kwDORu5