ing:\n- Beyond code: technical direction, mentorship, sponsorship, glue work\n- Trade-offs explicit at onset, not discovered with regret (Allspaw)\n- Boring technology as a feature; proven over exciting\n- Lift others: individual heroics have a ceiling\n- Avoid Cover Your Ass Engineering; accept responsibility\n- ADRs for architectural decisions\n- Permission + notification pattern built into workflow","tree":{"sha":"f33d7ddc04a10ffa084365a55a10af6308869bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/f33d7ddc04a10ffa084365a55a10af6308869bf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/826695fad4380a35fcdd4d4ec995b96f0c03dd94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/826695fad4380a35fcdd4d4ec995b96f0c03dd94","node_id":"C_kwDORu5NRNoAKDgyNjY5NWZhZDQzODBhMzVmY2RkNGQ0ZWM5OTViOTZmMGMwM2RkOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/7e54b60343d4f3052d7502fb4d80824f1c80c54b","sha":"7e54b60343d4f3052d7502fb4d80824f1c80c54b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/7e54b60343d4f3052d7502fb4d80824f1c80c54b"}],"sha":"826695fad4380a35fcdd4d4ec995b96f0c03dd94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/826695fad4380a35fcdd4d4ec995b96f0c03dd94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commits/7e54b60343d4f3052d7502fb4d80824f1c80c54b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:33:36Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T23:33:36Z","email":"pranav8494@gmail.com","name":"Pranav P"},"message":"S6: add ux-researcher skill\n\nResearched from: Nielsen Norman Group UX research cheat sheet,\nNN/g research methods landscape (attitudinal vs behavioural,\nqualitative vs quantitative, generative vs evaluative).\n\nKey grounding:\n- Three-dimensional method framework from NN/g\n- Four research phases: Discover, Explore, Test, Listen\n- Attitudinal vs behavioural gap as core mental model\n- Jobs-to-be-Done and Double Diamond frameworks\n- Small-n qualitative defence (5 participants = 85% of issues)\n- Observation vs interpretation separation as quality standard\n- Permission + notification pattern built into workflow","tree":{"sha":"67d5a7bd80527c2290f0b37fc5e65a6d6354ea3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/trees/67d5a7bd80527c2290f0b37fc5e65a6d6354ea3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pranav8494/team-of-agents/git/commits/7e54b60343d4f3052d7502fb4d80824f1c80c54b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3798284?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494","id":3798284,"login":"pranav8494","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3OTgyODQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pranav8494","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/7e54b60343d4f3052d7502fb4d80824f1c80c54b","node_id":"C_kwDORu5NRNoAKDdlNTRiNjAzNDNkNGYzMDUyZDc1MDJmYjRkODA4MjRmMWM4MGM1NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pranav8494/team-of-agents/commit/6ed90047e25f95c9acb6f2929e8cfe1