rosscarter@gmail.com","name":"monobyte"},"message":"feat: take the shared app-state lock and echo the host''s etag (sero#428)\n\nThe Sero host now serialises every mutation of state.json behind a\ncross-process mkdir lock. Mutating notes tool actions (add, edit, remove,\npin, unpin) now read and write under the same lock via withStateLock, so\na tool call cannot interleave with a panel edit. The UI already goes\nthrough useAppState, which handles the new etag protocol. Bumps\nruntimeAbi to 3 and @sero-ai/app-runtime to ^0.4.1.","tree":{"sha":"bf8408b67ac244dc14ff4b84a768fe7d650218fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-notes-plugin/git/trees/bf8408b67ac244dc14ff4b84a768fe7d650218fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-notes-plugin/git/commits/85a4bbaac5c10f1d8dbb8e33d4f7c90b78978297","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monobyte","id":128296,"login":"monobyte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI5Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/monobyte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero-notes-plugin/commit/85a4bbaac5c10f1d8dbb8e33d4f7c90b78978297","node_id":"C_kwDOR