hes on its first hook.\n\nAlso declares sero.plugin.runtimeAbi: 2 — the host refuses to mount a UI whose\nABI does not match, showing a reinstall prompt instead of crashing. The version\nis pinned exactly: a caret range resolves to a newer line on a fresh install\nand silently breaks React sharing.","tree":{"sha":"67dc5acf2166ac0b7cb722041aceab001154ddc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/git/trees/67dc5acf2166ac0b7cb722041aceab001154ddc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/git/commits/b9ae6d25ca5503e5ad4d93e8d7810ecda71ab248","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/commit/b9ae6d25ca5503e5ad4d93e8d7810ecda71ab248","node_id":"C_kwDORu8Li9oAKGI5YWU2ZDI1Y2E1NTAzZTVhZDRkOTNlOGQ3ODEwZWNkYTcxYWIyNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/commit/24f3ee669652bc9c36d541fc0e3e39c338b6b4d6","sha":"24f3ee669652bc9c36d541fc0e3e39c338b6b4d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/commits/24f3ee669652bc9c36d541fc0e3e39c338b6b4d6"}],"sha":"b9ae6d25ca5503e5ad4d93e8d7810ecda71ab248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/commits/b9ae6d25ca5503e5ad4d93e8d7810ecda71ab248"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/commits/24f3ee669652bc9c36d541fc0e3e39c338b6b4d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:49:51Z","email":"sero@sero.ai","name":"Sero"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T13:49:51Z","email":"sero@sero.ai","name":"Sero"},"message":"fix: declare plugin package as ESM","tree":{"sha":"14e8aa59c1cbff02e66a7873407a1bc91f7d30d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-slopzilla-plugin/git/trees/14e8aa59c1cbff02e66a7873407a1bc91f7d30d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sero-labs/sero-slopzil