лизировать визуальные контракты. Дополнительно фиксирует migration boundaries/DoD в документации, переводит host/MFE на shared BFF adapter и подключает CI-проверки для раннего обнаружения регрессий.","tree":{"sha":"2e36909b9531bad066dd3d4f5de8034b0791340d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/2e36909b9531bad066dd3d4f5de8034b0791340d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/666c3939210b591248d10bf712d3a469705a183a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/666c3939210b591248d10bf712d3a469705a183a","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKDY2NmMzOTM5MjEwYjU5MTI0OGQxMGJmNzEyZDNhNDY5NzA1YTE4M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9","sha":"c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9"}],"sha":"666c3939210b591248d10bf712d3a469705a183a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/666c3939210b591248d10bf712d3a469705a183a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T11:20:41Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T11:20:41Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"message":"Привести UI host и MFE к Figma в mobile-first стиле\n\nУнифицированы shell и ключевые экраны host/mf-recipes/mf-planner/mf-shopping: token-based стили, адаптив 390/768/1200, согласованные CTA/формы/карточки и состояния. Добавлен чеклист UI parity в docs, smoke e2e (auth + planner/shopping) проходит без регрессий.","tree":{"sha":"6e04cd1225920d9d08b0a43682d12fcf50b0a12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/6e04cd1225920d9d08b0a43682d12fcf50b0a12e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKGM3NTc3NDQ4OTI1NjczM2ZmYTM2MzU5ZDc1MDJkMTA5ZGM4N2QwZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707","sha":"7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707"}],"sha":"c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/c75774489256733ffa36359d7502d109dc87d0e9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:02:07Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T06:02:07Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"message":"Добавить E2E UC-2/UC-3, стабилизировать full-stack smoke и усилить устойчивость планировщика\n\nРазделил smoke-тесты и добавил full-stack сценарии UC-2/UC-3 (планирование слота и формирование списка покупок) через BFF с credentials include.\nТакже добавил стабильные data-testid в mf-planner/mf-shopping, выровнял e2e-stack по VITE_BFF_BASE_URL, ввёл healthcheck для recipe-catalog/meal-planning и один авто-ретрай PATCH при VERSION_CONFLICT в planner.","tree":{"sha":"20e69d9e59de692e70603dc39d5ad3895e242537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/20e69d9e59de692e70603dc39d5ad3895e242537"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKDc1NzNmZTQ0MGIyMWViMGI1MGM4N2M5YjNhYzUwMDY5YTJiYzg3MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45","sha":"9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45"}],"sha":"7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/7573fe440b21eb0b50c87c9b3ac50069a2bc8707"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T05:51:21Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T05:51:21Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"message":"feat: production-ready UX, BFF errors, E2E full-stack auth, contract alignment\n\n- OpenAPI: VERSION_CONFLICT as 400 + code; ShoppingListDetail.empty; import allowlist/error codes; sync bff-routes\n- @meal/bff-client: BffHttpError, bffErrorFromResponse/Message; json() throws typed errors\n- mf-planner: VERSION_CONFLICT reload + copy; shopping period validation; a11y on slot remove\n- mf-recipes: form validation + «по вкусу»; import messages by code; Library/Detail errors; plan modal a11y\n- mf-shopping: structured fetch errors; empty manual add hint\n- host: auth guards + login redirect; useSession uses bff errors\n- e2e: E2E_FULL_STACK fails if BFF down; workflow waits register probe; IAM healthcheck; BFF depends_on IAM healthy; Playwright report/trace artifacts\n- recipe-import: og:title fallback; allowlist/port test\n- meal-planning: HTTP test patch slot VERSION_CONFLICT\n- bff-web: integration test plan slot proxy VERSION_CONFLICT","tree":{"sha":"16a582c0b5a5dd17f492bf252e5e78324e12e08c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/16a582c0b5a5dd17f492bf252e5e78324e12e08c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKDlhM2Q5ZTRhMGIyOWI2ZmEyNzM4NTJlOWVhOGViMjMzNDc2YjNlNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8","sha":"e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8"}],"sha":"9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/9a3d9e4a0b29b6fa273852e9ea8eb233476b3e45"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T05:03:39Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T05:03:39Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"message":"feat(frontend): микрофронты по design-plan через BFF, E2E stack и доработки бэклога\n\n- Host: роуты /recipes*, /planner, /shopping/:listId; federation-экспорты Library,\n  ImportView, RecipeDetail/Form, PlannerPage, ShoppingPage; навигация в shell.\n- mf-recipes: библиотека (фильтры, «В план» через plan/week + PATCH слота), просмотр,\n  CRUD, импорт по URL с черновиком в форме.\n- mf-planner: неделя, слоты, боковая панель, календарь месяца, панель периода и\n  shopping/build → переход в список.\n- mf-shopping: список с группировкой, PATCH/POST/DELETE строк, экспорт в буфер,\n  пустое состояние.\n- @meal/bff-client: bff-types, bffPath для query.\n- OpenAPI + shopping-list: поле empty в ShoppingListDetail; BFF Dockerfile + curl,\n  healthcheck bff-web в docker-compose; комментарий IMPORT_ALLOWED_HOSTS.\n- meal-planning: тест PatchSlot при VERSION_CONFLICT (go-sqlmock); recipe-import:\n  fallback заголовка из h1 + тест.\n- CI: workflow e2e-stack.yml; обновлён e2e/README (--wait, ссылка на workflow).","tree":{"sha":"cbb1adac6b9e3d82b372e093704ff79652ac1c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/cbb1adac6b9e3d82b372e093704ff79652ac1c96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKGU0OWU2M2Y5MTk0N2QyYmIyN2QwYzA1MDQ5YzVkMTU5NjlkMzg3Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13","sha":"8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13"}],"sha":"e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/e49e63f91947d2bb27d0c05049c5d15969d387b8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:44:24Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:44:24Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"message":"BFF:\n- прокси POST /bff/v1/auth/register и /bff/v1/auth/password в IAM\n- SessionGuard: публичные login/register и OPTIONS; не трогать ответ, если уже задан (CORS)\n- CorrelationIdSubscriber с приоритетом выше SessionGuard для X-Correlation-Id на валидации сессии\n- CorsSubscriber: BFF_CORS_ALLOW_ORIGIN (CSV), preflight OPTIONS, credentials\n- интеграционные тесты CORS и расширение BffFlowTest\n\nIAM:\n- PATCH /users/me/password: X-User-Id, смена пароля в AuthService; UserRepository findByUserId/updatePasswordHash\n- тесты unit + integration\n\nFrontend:\n- пакет @meal/bff-client (credentials: include, correlation id)\n- host: Vue Router, login/register/logout, useSession, проверка сессии через GET /recipes?limit=1\n- mf: демо вызова /health через bff-client\n\nE2E:\n- auth.spec.ts (регистрация → session-banner), skip без BFF\n- playwright baseURL, e2e/README.md\n\nИнфра/док: BFF_CORS в docker-compose; frontend/README; solution-architecture про dev без gateway; .gitignore vendor/","tree":{"sha":"edab89246c6b79b684894fb683b3fd7c67f5260c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/edab89246c6b79b684894fb683b3fd7c67f5260c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKDhjMjdiZmNmZjQ0N2EyNGUxYmJkNjFjNTgxZjNmMmE3NGQ0ZWZhMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04","sha":"1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04"}],"sha":"8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/8c27bfcff447a24e1bbd61c581f3f2a74d4efa13"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:03:11Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T04:03:11Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"message":"feat(stack): вертикальный срез UC-1–UC-3 — сервисы, BFF, compose, CI\n\nBFF: полный прокси recipes CRUD, GET /bff/v1/plan/week с query, shopping lines;\nInternalApiClient с query-string; тесты.\n\nСервисы: recipe-catalog (Symfony, PDO, OpenAPI CRUD, Dockerfile :8082);\nrecipe-import (Go, whitelist, парсинг title, Dockerfile);\nmeal-planning (Go, Postgres, week/slots/assignments, Dockerfile :8085);\nshopping-list (Symfony, build→planning+catalog, снимок, replace периода, Dockerfile :8085).\n\nИнфра: расширен infra/docker-compose.app.yml (Postgres×4, все сервисы, bff-web);\nDockerfile для bff-web.\n\nCI: jobs recipe-catalog, shopping-list, go-services.","tree":{"sha":"d652d3a66d5afb29eb2ea5aa4d1994a06bbe052f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/d652d3a66d5afb29eb2ea5aa4d1994a06bbe052f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKDFhMmFkOWQ3YzY4M2NlMzkzMmNiMTQ2ZWQwMGQyNDQ2MTQyYzBmMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/a09e955b2c250b5bbe72efd14c7ef6c1efcd96e2","sha":"a09e955b2c250b5bbe72efd14c7ef6c1efcd96e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/a09e955b2c250b5bbe72efd14c7ef6c1efcd96e2"}],"sha":"1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/1a2ad9d7c683ce3932cb146ed00d2446142c0f04"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commits/a09e955b2c250b5bbe72efd14c7ef6c1efcd96e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T03:43:17Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T03:43:17Z","email":"danil.u@bnovo.ru","name":"Danil Ukhov"},"message":"feat(iam): сервис identity-access с PostgreSQL и сессиями в Redis\n\nРеализованы register, login, валидация и удаление сессий по OpenAPI;\nX-Internal-Auth на приватных маршрутах; compose infra/docker-compose.app.yml;\nDockerfile IAM; тесты IAM и интеграция BFF↔IAM (phpunit.iam.xml); job CI identity-access.","tree":{"sha":"05fcb17c071529cb89d4e7e83a7c5d0033e89f79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/trees/05fcb17c071529cb89d4e7e83a7c5d0033e89f79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/git/commits/a09e955b2c250b5bbe72efd14c7ef6c1efcd96e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/a09e955b2c250b5bbe72efd14c7ef6c1efcd96e2","node_id":"C_kwDORu-sCNoAKGEwOWU5NTViMmMyNTBiNWJiZTcyZWZkMTRjN2VmNmMxZWZjZDk2ZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sakralbar0192/family_meal-planning/commit/289b8393393c6e3a5d06f322dda8b6bca7f7b758","sha":"289b8393393c6e3a5d06f322dda8b6bca7f7b758","url":"h