 run brain → watch in terminal → watch in\n  React → add guardrails. Shows what happens under the hood.\n\nInstallation — simplified with one-install + individual packages,\n  Python with framework adapters, env vars reference.\n\nNew guides:\n  - providers.md: multi-provider setup, per-role overrides, failover\n  - evaluation.md: datasets, 5 scorers, live progress, reading results\n  - guardrails.md: 4 built-in guards, custom guards, warn mode\n  - caching.md: enable, stats, custom backend (Redis), how it works\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3805692f12783d02d00416f3b8e493ee0dfb5780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/trees/3805692f12783d02d00416f3b8e493ee0dfb5780"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/commits/37dfd118c01e87e1c60e2801e7ccad6ac98f1022","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SsebowaDisan","id":67627401,"login":"SsebowaDisan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjI3NDAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maia-sdk/maia/