ved_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/7104a020a9dcd709384a54c02f0f11219a1565c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T12:04:59Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T12:04:59Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"message":"feat: add 8 new Theatre surfaces (14 total) — chat, dashboard, kanban, database, CRM, diff, API, calendar\n\nP0 surfaces:\n- ChatSurface: Slack/Teams-like interface with messages, typing indicator\n- DashboardSurface: KPI cards, bar charts with data visualization\n- KanbanSurface: Board with columns, priority dots, assignees, labels\n- DatabaseSurface: SQL query bar + table results with headers and rows\n\nP1 surfaces:\n- CRMSurface: Contact/deal/lead cards with pipeline stages\n- DiffSurface: Code diff with red deletions + green additions\n- APISurface: Method badge, URL, status code, request/response JSON\n- CalendarSurface: Day view with time grid and color-coded events\n\n14 total surfaces. SurfaceRenderer auto-picks based on activity type.\nAll under 150 LOC (React component limit).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3097fb9f012af0e549bdc9cd1274d8108a80e0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/trees/b3097fb9f012af0e549bdc9cd1274d8108a80e0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/commits/7104a020a9dcd709384a54c02f0f11219a1565c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fa