 CI/CD, deployment, monitoring, infrastructure (DevOps)\n- it_infrastructure: Servers, networking, DNS, security policies (IT)\n- marketing: Campaigns, brand, positioning, growth (Business)\n\nEach has: role definition, personality profile, inferRole pattern, system prompt.\n27 total roles covering every department in a company.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01d3ef9628028870b3bf059feb122f927de3a0ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/trees/01d3ef9628028870b3bf059feb122f927de3a0ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/commits/0437f32e884550eaa9457158635780c8800b9b2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SsebowaDisan","id":67627401,"login":"SsebowaDisan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjI3NDAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maia-sdk/maia/commit/0437f32e884550eaa9457158635780c8800b9b2b","node_id":"C_kwDORvIePdoAKDA0MzdmMzJlODg0NTUwZWFhOTQ1NzE1ODYzNTc4MGM4ODAwYjliMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maia-sdk/maia/commit/0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f","sha":"0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f"}],"sha":"0437f32e884550eaa9457158635780c8800b9b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/0437f32e884550eaa9457158635780c8800b9b2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SsebowaDisan","id":67627401,"login":"SsebowaDisan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjI3NDAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T10:22:33Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T10:22:33Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"message":"feat: add personality system, memory, narration, 11 new roles, conversation improvements\n\nNatural conversation improvements:\n- personality.ts: 20 distinct voice profiles — each agent has unique\n  vocabulary, sentence length, directness, disagreement/agreement style,\n  and quick-fire response templates\n- memory.ts: Cross-run agent memory with token-based recall, 30-day\n  decay, decision extraction, serialize/deserialize for persistence\n- narration.ts: Tool narration layer — agents describe what they''re\n  doing (\"Let me check Bessemer''s report...\") instead of silent tool calls\n- prompts.ts: 7 new conversation prompts — quick-fire exchanges,\n  constructive friction, proactive sharing, natural handoffs, decision\n  anchoring, conversation compression\n\n11 new roles (20 total):\n  coder, data_scientist, designer, product_manager, qa_tester,\n  security_auditor, translator, customer_support, sales, finance, legal\n\nEach new role has: system prompt, personality profile, avatar, traits,\nrole inference pattern, and when-to-use guidance.\n\n15 files, 2,635 lines total, all under 300 LOC limit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd18162ce93e5420676959396c620141ea1fdea1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/trees/fd18162ce93e5420676959396c620141ea1fdea1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/commits/0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SsebowaDisan","id":67627401,"login":"SsebowaDisan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjI3NDAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maia-sdk/maia/commit/0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f","node_id":"C_kwDORvIePdoAKDBjMGE1OTNjZDRhYTRlMjNmODcyMWRmZjU4ZjllY2Y5NTBhMGY0NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maia-sdk/maia/commit/91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928","sha":"91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928"}],"sha":"0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/0c0a593cd4aa4e23f8721dff58f9ecf950a0f45f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SsebowaDisan","id":67627401,"login":"SsebowaDisan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjI3NDAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T10:00:20Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T10:00:20Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"message":"feat: add platform-parity features to SDK Brain — coverage, revision, dialogue, roles, state\n\nCloses all 16 gaps between platform Brain and SDK Brain.\n\nNew files:\n- coverage.ts: Semantic fact/action verification after each step\n  (LLM checks output satisfies contract, confidence threshold 0.65)\n- reviser.ts: Plan revision — LLM proposes 1-3 new steps to fill gaps\n- dialogue.ts: Dialogue detection (detect needs, propose seed turns,\n  evaluate follow-ups) — LLM decides when agents should talk mid-step\n- roles.ts: 9 predefined roles with system prompts, traits, avatars\n  (supervisor, researcher, browser, document_reader, analyst, reviewer,\n  writer, email_specialist, delivery)\n- guidance.ts: Anti-repetition rules, 8 chat intents, mood instructions,\n  conversation stall detection, pivot suggestions\n- state.ts: Full brain state — contract, coverage tracking, evidence pool,\n  step outcomes, signals, directives, revision budget\n\nUpdated files:\n- loops.ts: Added \"question\" verdict — Brain asks follow-up questions,\n  agent answers, then re-review continues\n- index.ts: Exports all new modules (45+ new exports)\n\n12 files, all under 300 LOC limit. Zero gaps remaining.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"249317585fc9a845f2afde296aa85f2ee4265b4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/trees/249317585fc9a845f2afde296aa85f2ee4265b4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/commits/91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SsebowaDisan","id":67627401,"login":"SsebowaDisan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjI3NDAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/maia-sdk/maia/commit/91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928","node_id":"C_kwDORvIePdoAKDkxYmZjZTlkNzU2ODJhZTFkYzFkOTE3N2E5NDk4OWMyYzA1MTE5Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/maia-sdk/maia/commit/2e92804f1822359be84ce7f32ede765978c5f0ee","sha":"2e92804f1822359be84ce7f32ede765978c5f0ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/2e92804f1822359be84ce7f32ede765978c5f0ee"}],"sha":"91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/91bfce9d75682ae1dc1d9177a94989c2c0511928"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SsebowaDisan","id":67627401,"login":"SsebowaDisan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjI3NDAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SsebowaDisan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/commits/2e92804f1822359be84ce7f32ede765978c5f0ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T09:22:07Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T09:22:07Z","email":"ssebowadisan1@gmail.com","name":"Disan Ssebowa Basalidde"},"message":"feat: split Theatre and TeamChat into separate packages\n\nTheatre (@maia/theatre) — actions only:\n- Tool calls, browsing, searching, screenshots, cost tracking\n- Removed chat tab and conversation components\n\nTeamChat (@maia/teamchat) — conversations only:\n- Agent-to-agent dialogue with threaded bubbles\n- Intent-colored borders (challenge=red, agree=green, etc.)\n- Review badges inline (approve/revise/reject)\n- Typing indicators from activity events\n- useConversationStream hook filters messages + reviews only\n\nDevelopers use either or both:\n  <Theatre streamUrl=\"/acp/events\" />\n  <TeamChat streamUrl=\"/acp/events\" />\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b4b9ef05f414052dce87b87f20b5414a01f815b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/trees/1b4b9ef05f414052dce87b87f20b5414a01f815b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/maia-sdk/maia/git/commits/2e92804f1822359be84ce7f32ede765978c5f0ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67627401?v=4","events_url":"https://